','messages'=>[' (Submit Button)'=>' (提交按鈕)',' In wpDiscuz 7 the real-time commenting becomes more live and attractive. It\'s based on REST API and doesn\'t overload your server. A specific sticky comment icon on your web pages, called &laquo;Bubble&raquo; keeps article readers and commenters up to date. It can display new comments as pop-up notification or as number in an orange circle.'=>'在 wpDiscuz 7中，即時留言變得更加生動有趣。它基於REST API，不會使服務器過載。您網頁上的特定黏性留言圖示氣泡，可以使文章讀者和留言者保持最新狀態。它可以將新留言顯示為彈出式通知，也可以顯示為橙色圓圈中的數字。',' Thank you!<br/> Sincerely yours,<br/> gVectors Team&nbsp;'=>'謝謝！<br/>真誠的你，gVectors Team&nbsp;','"Bulk management via email" description'=>'「批次管理郵件」的說明','"My Content and Settings" button'=>'「我的內容和設定」按鈕','#1 WordPress Comment Plugin. Innovative, modern and feature-rich comment system to supercharge your website comment section.'=>'WordPress第一名的留言外掛。創新、現代且功能豐富的留言系統，可充實您網站的留言部分。','%s addon was deactivated, because your license isn\'t valid.'=>'%s 外掛已停用，因為您的授權無效。','%sK'=>'%sK','%sM'=>'%sM','&laquo;'=>'&laquo;','&lsaquo;'=>'&lsaquo;','&raquo;'=>'&raquo;','&rsaquo;'=>'&rsaquo;','[Load more] Button'=>'[載入更多] 按鈕','[Load rest of all comments] Button'=>'[載入剩餘留言] 按鈕','[REDIRECT_URL]'=>'[REDIRECT_URL]','A full-fledged tool-kit for advertising in comment section of your website. Separate banner and ad managment.'=>'在網站的留言部分為廣告提供了一個完整的工具包。 獨立的橫幅和廣告管理。','A simple question or a call to leave a feedback on the selected part of text. Something like &quot;By the way. Do you agree with this?&quot; or &quot;Would love your thoughts, please comment on this.&quot;'=>'一個簡單的問題或行動呼籲，以對文字的所選部分留下反饋。像是：「你同意這個說法嗎？」或是「說說您為什麼喜歡的想法，請對此發表留言」。','Active Users and Guests'=>'活動使用者和訪客','Activity'=>'活動','Add Comment Form'=>'新增留言表單','Add Field'=>'新增欄位','Add Inline Commenting forms in article!'=>'增加內嵌留言表單在文章！','Add Inline Feedback Button'=>'增加內嵌反饋按鈕','Add New'=>'新增','Add New Form'=>'新增表單','ADD ROW'=>'新增一列','Add To Form'=>'新增表單','Addons'=>'附加元件','Addons Settings'=>'附加元件設定','Addons Support Forum'=>'附加元件技術討論區','Adds Giphy [GIF] button and opens popup where you can search for gifs and insert them in comment content.'=>'添加 Giphy [GIF] 按鈕並打開彈出視窗，您可以在其中搜尋 gif ，並將它們插入留言內容。','Adds Invisible reCAPTCHA on all comment forms. Stops spam and bot comments with reCAPTCHA version 3'=>'在所有留言表單上增加隱形的 reCAPTCHA。使用 reCAPTCHA v3 來阻止垃圾郵件和機器人留言','Adds Tenor [GIF] button and opens popup where you can search for gifs and insert them in comment content.'=>'增加 [GIF] 按鈕並開啟彈出視窗，您可以在其中搜尋 gif 並將其插入留言內容中。','Admin'=>'管理員','Ads Manager'=>'Ads 管理器','Advanced Likers'=>'進階按讚者','Advanced Options'=>'進階設定','Advanced spam protection with wpDiscuz Google reCAPTCHA addon. This addon adds No-CAPTCHA reCAPTCHA on all comment forms. Stops spam and bot comments.'=>'先進的垃圾內容防護與 wpDiscuz Google reCAPTCHA外掛。 這個外掛增加所有留言表單上的 No-CAPTCHA reCAPTCHA。阻止垃圾內容和 bot留言。','After Content'=>'在內容之後','Aggregate rating schema is a code integrated with post rating HTML. This enables Google to feature your post ratings and attract customers with it. When searching the internet, people will see your posts search results with star ratings. Even though those results are not at the top of search engine results page, those sites caught people attention first.'=>'綜合評分架構是與文章評分 HTML 整合的代碼。如此一來，Google 就能展示您的文章評分，並以此吸引客戶。在網路上搜尋時，人們會在搜尋結果中看到您的文章帶有評分星級。即使這些結果不在搜尋引擎結果頁面的頂部，這些網站還是先引起了人們的注意。','Aggregate rating schema is a code integrated with post rating HTML. This enables Google to feature your post ratings and attract customers with it. When searching the internet, people will see your posts search results with star ratings. Even though those results are not at the top of search engine results page, those sites caught people attention first. If your website does not sell Products, we do not recommend activating this option. For more details, please %s.'=>'綜合評分模式是與文章評分 HTML 整合的代碼。這使 Google 能夠展示您的文章評分並以此吸引客戶。在網路上搜尋時，人們會看到帶有星級評分的文章搜尋結果。儘管這些結果不在搜尋引擎結果頁面的頂部，但這些網站首先引起了人們的注意。如果您的網站不銷售產品，我們不建議激活此選項。有關詳細資訊，請 %s。','ago'=>'之前','Ago text'=>'之前文本','Agree'=>'同意','AJAX powered front-end comment search. It starts searching while you type search words. '=>'Ajax驅動的前端留言搜索。當您輸入搜索詞時啟動搜索。','Alert message before deleting attached file'=>'刪除附件前的警告訊息','All 16 addons in one bundle. Save 90% and get Unlimited Site License with one year premium support.'=>'全部 16 個外掛都在一個同捆包中。省下90％並取得一年進階支援的無限制網站授權。','All Comments'=>'所有留言','All comments'=>'所有留言','All in one powerful yet simple admin toolkit to moderate comments on front-end.'=>'用於前端審核留言的簡單且強大的管理工具','All old versions of addons are not compatible with wpDiscuz 7, because of new comment layouts and template functions. In order to avoid errors wpDiscuz deactivates those during the update process.'=>'由於新的留言佈局和模板功能，所有舊版本的外掛均與 wpDiscuz 7 不相容。為了避免錯誤，wpDiscuz 在更新過程中會將其停用。','All problems displayed above have fixing tips in the same boxes. If, for some reason you can\'t solve those problems, we\'re ready to help you and fix those as soon as possible. Please open a support topic at gVectors support forum or contact as via support@gvectors.com email address. Our support team works from 6am till 6pm in GMT+0 timezone. Please be patient when you open a new support topic or when contacting us via email. We\'ll get back to you within 3-12 hours.'=>'上面顯示的所有問題在同一框中都有修復提示。如果由於某種原因您無法解決這些問題，我們已準備好為您提供協助，並儘快解決這些問題。請在 gVectors 支援論壇中開啟支援主題，或透過 support@gvectors.com 電子郵件地址與我們聯繫。我們的支援團隊在格林尼治標準時間 +0 時區從 早上6點到下午6點 工作。當您開啟新的支援主題，或透過電子郵件與我們聯繫時，請耐心等候。我們會在3~12個小時內與您聯繫。','All Time'=>'所有時間','All wpDiscuz addons are being developed by wpDiscuz developers at gVectors Team. These addons help us to keep top level development of the free wpDiscuz plugin. All essential and even dozens of extra-cool features are already available for free in the core wpDiscuz plugin. There are not any limits, any pro and paid versions of wpDiscuz. We have another dozens of awesome features in our to-do list which will be added for free in the future releases.'=>'gVectors 團隊的 wpDiscuz 開發人員正在開發所有 wpDiscuz 外掛。 這些外掛幫助我們保持免費 wpDiscuz 外掛的頂級開發。wpDiscuz 核心外掛已免費提供所有必要的甚至數十種超酷功能。wpDiscuz 沒有任何限制，任何專業版和付費版本。我們的待辦事項列表中還有其他十個很棒的功能，這些功能將在以後的版本中免費加入。','All wpDiscuz Addons are Deactivated!'=>'所有 wpDiscuz 外掛均已停用！','Allow guests to comment'=>'同意訪客留言','Allow Guests to Rate'=>'允許訪客評分','Allow guests to view comments'=>'允許訪客查看留言','Allow Guests to Vote for Comments'=>'允許訪客投票發表留言','Allow Media Uploading for Guests'=>'允許訪客上傳媒體','Allowed File Types'=>'允許的檔案類型','Allows to create private comment threads. Rich management options in dashboard by user roles.'=>'允許建立私人留言串。 按會員角色在儀表板中提供豐富的管理選項。','Allows to discuss with your voice in the comment section. Adds a microphone button to the comment form.'=>'允許在留言區塊用您的聲音進行討論。向留言表單加入麥克風按鈕。','Allows to embed lots of video, social network, audio and photo content providers URLs in comment content.'=>'允許在留言內容中嵌入大量影片、社群網路、音檔和照片內容的提供商 URL。','Allows to mention comments and users in comment text using #comment-id and @username tags.'=>'允許使用＃comment-id 和 @username 標記在留言文字中提及留言和會員。','Allows to set minimum and maximum number of chars can be inserted in comment textarea. Leave the max value empty to remove the limit.'=>'允許設置在輸入留言文字區域的欄位中，可使用的最小和最大字數。將最大值保留為空以刪除限制。','Allows to set minimum and maximum number of chars can be inserted in reply textarea. Leave the max value empty to remove the limit.'=>'允許設定可以在回覆文字區域中，插入的最小和最大字元數。將最大值留空以移除限制。','Also used for field placeholder'=>'用於欄位的提示文字','Animate (blink and wiggle)'=>'動畫（閃爍和擺動）','Animation for "Leave a Feedback" button in article content'=>'文章內容中「留下反饋」按鈕的動畫','Anonymous'=>'匿名','Anonymous commenter name'=>'匿名留言人名字','App ID'=>'App ID','App Secret'=>'App Secret','Application ID'=>'Application ID','Application Key'=>'Application Key','Application Secret'=>'應用程式密鑰','Are you sure you want to cancel this follow?'=>'確定要取消此關注嗎？','Are you sure you want to cancel this subscription?'=>'確定要取消此訂閱嗎？','Are you sure you want to delete this attachment?'=>'確定要刪除此附件嗎？','Are you sure you want to delete this comment?'=>'確定要刪除此留言嗎？','Are you sure you want to reset fields ratings?'=>'確定要重置欄位評分嗎？','Are you sure you want to reset post rating?'=>'確定要重置文章評分嗎？','Article and Comment Rating'=>'文章和留言評分','Article Inline Feedback'=>'文章內嵌反饋','Article Inline Feedback feature is an interactive article reading option with author\'s questions and readers feedback (comments). Now article authors can add some questions for readers on certain part of article content and ask for feedback while visitors read it.'=>'文章線上反饋功能是一種交互式的文章閱讀選項，其中包含作者的問題和讀者的反饋（留言）。 現在文章作者可以在文章內容的某些部分為讀者增加一些問題，並在訪客閱讀文章時徵求反饋。','Article Rating'=>'文章評分','Article Rating vs Comment Rating'=>'文章評分 vs 留言評分','Article Rating vs Rating Field'=>'文章評分 vs 評分欄','Ask for Feedback'=>'尋求反饋','Ask questions to readers and discuss directly on article content!'=>'向讀者提問，直接就文章內容進行討論！','at least'=>'至少','Attach an image to this comment'=>'將圖片附加到此留言','Attached Images'=>'附加圖片','Authentication failed.'=>'驗證失敗。','Author'=>'作者','Auto'=>'自動','Available shortcodes'=>'可用的短代碼','Avatar Settings'=>'頭像設定','Average Rating'=>'平均分數','Awaiting for approval'=>'等待批准','Back'=>'返回','Background Color'=>'背景顏色','Backup Options'=>'備分設定','Backup Phrases'=>'備份慣用語','Baidu authentication failed (access_token does not exist).'=>'Baidu 身份驗證失敗（access_token不存在）。','Baidu authentication failed (code does not exist).'=>'Baidu 身份驗證失敗（代碼不存在）。','Baidu authentication failed (OAuth state does not exist).'=>'Baidu 身份驗證失敗（OAuth狀態不存在）。','Baidu Client ID'=>'Baidu 客戶端ID','Baidu Client ID and Client Secret  required.'=>'Baidu 客戶端ID 和 客戶端密鑰 為必填。','Baidu Client Secret'=>'Baidu 客戶端密鑰','Baidu Login Button'=>'Baidu 登入按鈕','Be the first to comment'=>'您將是第一位留言人','Be the First to Comment!'=>'成為第一個留言的人！','Before Comment Form'=>'留言表單前','Before Content'=>'在內容之前','Before, you had to create a Rating field in comment form to allow users rate article while they post a comment, there was no way to rate without commenting. Now you can allow users rate your articles without leavening a comment. wpDiscuz 7 has a built-in Post Rating system which is not based on comment form custom fields. You can see that on top of comment section like the left one on the screenshot below:'=>'以前，您必須在留言表單中建立「評分」欄位，以允許使用者在他們發表留言時對文章進行評分，而沒有留言就無法進行評分。現在，您可以允許使用者對您的文章進行評分，而無需發表留言。wpDiscuz 7 具有內建的文章評分系統，該系統不基於留言表單自訂欄位。您可以在留言區域的頂部看到它，就像下面的螢幕截圖中的左側一樣：','Before, you had to create a Rating field in comment form to allow users rate article while they post a comment, there was no way to rate without commenting. Now you can allow users rate your articles without leaving a comment. wpDiscuz 7 has a built-in Article Rating system which is not based on comment form custom fields and appears on top of comment section, under the article content.'=>'以前，您必須在留言表單中建立「評分」欄位，以允許使用者在他們發表留言時對文章進行評分，而沒有留言就無法進行評分。現在，您可以允許使用者對您的文章進行評分而無需發表留言。wpDiscuz 7 具有一個內建的「文章評分」系統，該系統不基於留言表單自訂欄位，而是顯示在文章內容下方「留言」部分的頂部。','Blockquote'=>'區塊引言','Bold'=>'粗體','Both'=>'兩者','Brings an ocean of emotions to your comments. It comes with an awesome smile package.'=>'為您的留言增加表情包。有酷酷的微笑包哦','Bubble - Hide the invitation message in X seconds'=>'泡泡框 - 在 X 秒內隱藏邀請訊息','Bubble - Invite to comment in X seconds'=>'泡泡框 - 在 X 秒內邀請發表留言','Bubble - Notify on New Comments'=>'泡泡框 - 通知新留言','Bubble Live Update'=>'氣泡即時更新','Built to Engage'=>'專為 Engage 設計','Bulk management via email'=>'批次管理郵件','Button Text'=>'按鈕文字','By default child comments are sorted by oldest on top. Using this option you can revers child comments order and sort them by newest on top.'=>'預設情況下，次級留言依照最舊的排序。使用此選項，您可以顛倒次級留言的順序，並按最新的順序對其進行排序。','By default the inline feedback form is closed and only the button is displayed. Once reader scrolled and reached to the selected text part, this button animates with comment button size and color changes attracting readers attention. Readers click on the button and open your question with feedback form. Using this option you can keep opened the feedback form. Readers can close it using [x] button.'=>'預設情況下，嵌入式反饋表單是關閉的，並且僅顯示按鈕。讀者捲動並到達選定的文字區域後，此按鈕將以留言按鈕的大小和顏色變化進行動畫處理，進而引起讀者的注意。讀者點擊按鈕後，使用反饋表單打開您的問題。使用此選項，您可以保持開啟反饋表單。讀者可以使用 [x] 按鈕將其關閉。','By default wpDiscuz adds a link with comment author avatar to the author profile page, you can disable this link using this option. However in case you use some plugin with User Profile page, you should keep this option enabled. wpDiscuz is well integrated with %s, BuddyPress and Ultimate Member profile builder plugins.'=>'預設情況下，wpDiscuz 將帶有留言作者頭像的連結增加到作者個人檔案頁面，您可以使用此選項禁用此連結。但是，如果您在「使用者個人檔案」頁面上使用某些外掛，則應保持啟用此選項。wpDiscuz 與 %s，BuddyPress 和 Ultimate Member 個人檔案產生器外掛很好地整合在一起。','By default, comment date is displayed with the human readable format, such as [X days ago]. For some languages, you may need to change the sequence of words in this date. This option provides shordcodes for each word allowing you manage the order. [number] is the \'X\', [time_unit] is the \'days\', [adjective] is the \'ago\'.'=>'預設情況下，留言日期以人們可讀的格式顯示，例如 [X天前]。對於某些語言，您可能需要更改此日期中的單詞順序。此選項為每個單詞提供 shordcodes，使您可以管理順序。[number] 是“ X”，[time_unit] 是“ days”，[adjective] 是“ ago”。','By default, only the comment text field is visible. When you click on the comment text field it opens all other fields (Name, Email, Website, etc...). If you want to keep all fields open, please set this option "expended".'=>'預設情況下，只能看見留言文字欄位。當您點擊留言文字欄位時，它才會展開將所有其他欄位（如：姓名、電子郵件、網站等...）。如果您希望所有欄位保持開啟狀態，請將此選項設定為「展開」。','By disabling this option you\'re automatically enabling wpDiscuz custom AJAX functions, which are many times faster that the default WordPress functions. Just make sure it doesn\'t conflict with your plugins.'=>'透過禁用此設定，您將自動啟用 wpDiscuz 自訂 AJAX 函數，這些函數比預設 WordPress 函數快許多倍。只要確保它不會與您的其他外掛衝突。','Cache Reset Frequency'=>'快取重置頻率','Cancel'=>'取消','Cancel all comment subscriptions'=>'取消所有留言訂閱','Cancel comment editing button text'=>'取消留言編輯按鈕文本','Cancel following link text'=>'取消關注連結文字','Cancel subscription'=>'取消訂閱','Cancel this follow'=>'取消此關注','Cancel this subscription'=>'取消此訂閱','Cancel user following request'=>'取消使用者關注請求','Cannot back up the options!'=>'無法備份設定！','Cannot back up the phrases!'=>'無法備份慣用語！','Change the attached ima