he agreement is accepted once'=>'一旦同意使用者規範，將不再顯示','Done'=>'完成','Download Options'=>'下載設定','Download Phrases'=>'下載慣用語','e.g: Any thoughts on this?'=>'例如：對此有何想法？','Edit'=>'編輯','Edit Button - Allow comment editing for'=>'編輯按鈕 - 允許編輯留言','Edit Form'=>'編輯表單','Editor'=>'編輯器','Email'=>'E-mail','email address is invalid'=>'無效的E-Mail地址','Email Field'=>'郵箱欄位','email for feedback'=>'透過電子郵件取得反饋','Email Template Phrases'=>'郵件範本慣用語','Emoticons'=>'表情','Enable'=>'啟用','Enable Aggregate Rating Schema'=>'啟用綜合評分架構','Enable Article Rating'=>'啟用文章評價','Enable button'=>'啟用按鈕','Enable Cache'=>'啟用快取','Enable Comments and Users Cache'=>'啟用留言和使用者快取','Enable down vote button (dislike)'=>'啟用否決按鈕（不喜歡）','Enable drop animation for comment form and subscription bar'=>'啟用投放動畫於留言表單和訂閱欄','Enable editing for replied comments'=>'啟用編輯已回覆留言','Enable for Guests'=>'為訪客啟用','Enable for Logged-in Users'=>'為登入使用者啟用','Enable formatting toolbar'=>'啟用格式工具欄','Enable Lightbox for Attached Images'=>'為附加的圖片啟用燈箱','Enable Live Update for Guests'=>'為訪客啟用即時更新','Enable Media Uploading'=>'啟用媒體上傳','Enable Post Rating'=>'啟用文章評分','Enable Profiles URL'=>'啟用個人檔案網址','Enable Quicktags'=>'啟用快速標籤','Enable Sitewide Usage of Default Avatars'=>'啟用預設頭像的網站範圍使用','Enable subscription bar'=>'啟用訂閱欄','Enable subscription confirmation for guests'=>'為訪客啟用訂閱確認','Enable subscription confirmation for registered users'=>'啟用註冊使用者的訂閱確認','Enable User Following Feature'=>'啟用使用者關注功能','Enable User Mentioning'=>'啟用標註使用者','Enable WordPress Shortcodes in Comment Content'=>'在留言內容中啟用 WordPress 短代碼','Enable wpDiscuz on Home Page'=>'在首頁啟用 wpDiscuz','Enter link:'=>'輸入連結：','Error : Can\'t send email.'=>'錯誤：無法寄送郵件。','Error message for empty field'=>'空欄位的錯誤消息','Error message for invalid email field'=>'無效郵箱欄位的錯誤消息','Error message for invalid website url field'=>'無效URL欄位的錯誤消息','Error occured! Can not get file content!'=>'發生錯誤！ 無法取得檔案內容！','Error occured! File content is empty or data is not valid!'=>'發生錯誤！ 檔案內容為空或數據無效！','Error occured! Please choose file!'=>'發生錯誤！ 請選擇檔案！','Errors'=>'錯誤','Every 48 hours'=>'每 48 小時','Example en'=>'例子中','Example: #00FF00'=>'例如：#00FF00','expanded'=>'展開','Export / Import options'=>'匯入/匯出 設定','Export / Import phrases'=>'匯入/匯出 慣用語','Extended comment attachment system. Allows to upload images, videos, audios and other file types.'=>'擴展的留言附件模組，允許上傳圖片、視頻、音訊和其他檔案類型。','Extended information about comment author with Profile, Activity, Votes and Subscriptions Tabs on pop-up window.'=>'關於留言作者的擴展資訊，在彈出視窗中包含 Profile，Activity，Votes 和 Subscriptions 標籤。','Facebook access token or user ID invalid.'=>'Facebook 存取token 或 會員ID 無效。','Facebook App Secret is required.'=>'Facebook App Secret 為必填。','Facebook Application ID'=>'Facebook 應用程式ID','Facebook Application ID and Application Secret  required.'=>'需要Facebook應用程序ID和應用程序密鑰。','Facebook Application Secret'=>'Facebook 應用程式密鑰','Facebook authentication failed (OAuth code does not exist).'=>'Facebook 身份驗證失敗（OAuth代碼不存在）。','Facebook authentication failed (OAuth state does not exist).'=>'Facebook 身份驗證失敗（OAuth狀態不存在）。','Facebook Login Button'=>'Facebook 登入按鈕','Facebook Share Button'=>'Facebook 分享按鈕','Feedback Button Display Type'=>'反饋按鈕顯示類型','Feedback on post content'=>'對文章內容的反饋','Field icon'=>'欄位圖示','Field is required'=>'必填欄位','field is required!'=>'必填欄位！','Field specific short description or some rule related to inserted information.'=>'欄位特定的短描述或與插入訊息相關的某些規則。','Field Types'=>'欄位類型','File Attachment Settings'=>'附件檔案設定','File is empty. Please upload something more substantial. This error could also be caused by uploads being disabled in your php.ini or by post_max_size being defined as smaller than upload_max_filesize in php.ini.'=>'檔案是空的。請確認上傳的內容是否完整。此錯誤也可能是由於您的 php.ini 中的上傳功能被停用，或 post_max_size 被定義為小於 php.ini 中的 upload_max_filesize 所造成的。','Find an option...'=>'尋找一個選項...','Finish Installation'=>'完成安裝','Finish Update'=>'完成更新','First time in blog commenting experience we introduce, the Inline Feedback feature. This is an interactive article reading option with questions and feedback. Now article authors can add some questions for readers on certain part of article content and ask for feedback while visitors read it.'=>'我們首次引入部落格留言經驗，也就是線上反饋功能。這是具有問題和反饋的交互式文章閱讀選項。現在文章作者可以在文章內容的某些部分為讀者增加一些問題，並在訪客閱讀文章時徵求反饋。','Fix Tables'=>'修復資料表','Fix the problem: '=>'修正問題：','Follow'=>'關注','Follow confirmation email content'=>'關注確認電子郵件內容','Follow confirmation email subject'=>'關注確認電子郵件主題','Follow email content'=>'關注Email內容','Follow has been canceled successfully'=>'關注已成功取消','Follow has been confirmed successfully'=>'關注已成功確認','Follow this user'=>'關注此會員','Follow Users Phrases'=>'關注會員慣用語','Follow users without email confirmation'=>'關注會員不需確認電子郵件','Followers'=>'粉絲數','Following'=>'關注中','Following email subject'=>'關注Email主題','Following failed. Please try again later.'=>'關注失敗，請稍後再試。','Follows'=>'關注','Font-awesome icon library.'=>'Font-awesome 圖示庫。','Form'=>'表單','Form subscription button'=>'表單訂閱按鈕','Form Template Phrases'=>'表單範本慣用語','Forms'=>'表單','Front-end Moderation'=>'前端審核','Frontend Moderation'=>'前端審核','General'=>'一般','General Colors'=>'一般顏色','General Phrases'=>'一般慣用語','General Settings'=>'一般設定','Generate Thumbnail Sizes'=>'產生縮略圖大小','Get all wpDiscuz premium addons with unlimited site license and save 90% with'=>'獲得具有無限網站許可的所有 wpDiscuz 進階外掛，並節省 90％ 的費用','Getting Started'=>'入門','Getting started with'=>'開始使用','Go to "Comment Content and Media" admin page to manage image attachment settings'=>'前往「留言內容和媒體」管理頁面以管理附件圖片的設置','Go to Installation Wizard &raquo;'=>'前往安裝嚮導 &raquo;','Go to the addon page'=>'前往附加元件頁面','Go to Update Wizard &raquo;'=>'前往更新嚮導 &raquo;','Go to wpDiscuz Addons subMenu'=>'前往 wpDiscuz 擴充套件的子選單','Google authentication failed (OAuth code does not exist).'=>'Google 身份驗證失敗（OAuth代碼不存在）。','Google authentication failed (OAuth state does not exist).'=>'Google 身份驗證失敗（OAuth狀態不存在）。','Google Client ID'=>'Google 客戶端ID','Google Client ID and Client Secret  required.'=>'Google 客戶端ID 和 客戶端密鑰 為必填。','Google Client Secret'=>'Google 客戶端密鑰','Google Login Button'=>'Google 登入按鈕','Google ReCaptcha'=>'Google ReCaptcha','Google reCAPTCHA'=>'Google reCAPTCHA','Great News! Now you can add questions for readers on certain part of article content and ask for feedback while visitors read it.'=>'好消息！ 現在，您可以在文章內容的某些部分為讀者加入問題，並在訪客閱讀文章時徵求反饋。','Guest'=>'訪客','Guest Commenters'=>'訪客留言','gVectors Team'=>'gVectors 團隊','Hacker?'=>'駭客 ?','Height (px)'=>'高度 (px)','Help to Translate wpDiscuz'=>'協助翻譯 wpDiscuz','Help wpDiscuz to grow allowing people to recognize which comment plugin you use'=>'幫助 wpDiscuz 增長，允許顯示wpDiscuz外掛程式標識','Here you can find all necessary options to control comment threads loading, displaying and sorting functions. Using "Comment List Loading Type", "Comments Pagination Type" and "Display only parent comments" options, you can get the highest page loading speed.  Also you can manage comment thread filtering buttons.'=>'您可以在這裡找到所有必要的選項，來控制留言串的載入、顯示和排序功能。使用「留言列表載入類型」，「留言分頁類型」和「僅顯示上層留言」選項，可以獲得最快的頁面載入速度。您還可以管理留言串篩選按鈕。','Here you can import and restore wpDiscuz options. You just need to choose backup file and click import options.'=>'您可以在匯入和還原 wpDiscuz 設定。 您只需選擇備份檔案並點選匯入設定。','Here you can import and restore wpDiscuz phrases. You just need to choose backup file and click import phrases.'=>'在這裡您可以匯入和恢復 wpDiscuz 慣用語。您只需要選擇備份檔案，然後點擊匯入慣用語。','Here you can import comments\' images from <strong><i>Comment Images Reloaded</i></strong> plugin to wpDiscuz.'=>'您可以在此處將<strong><i>留言圖片重新載入</i></strong>外掛中的留言圖片匯入到 wpDiscuz。','Here you can import comments\' images from <strong><i>DCO Comment Attachment</i></strong> plugin to wpDiscuz.'=>'您可以在這裡將 <strong><i>DCO 留言附件</i></strong> 外掛中的留言圖片匯入 wpDiscuz。','Here you can import subscriptions from <strong><i>Lightweight Subscribe To Comments</i></strong> plugin to wpDiscuz.'=>'您可以在這裡將訂閱從 <strong><i>輕量級訂閱留言</i></strong> 外掛匯入到 wpDiscuz。','Here you can import subscriptions from <strong><i>Subscribe To Comments Reloaded</i></strong> plugin to wpDiscuz.'=>'您可以在這裡將訂閱從 <strong><i>訂閱留言重新載入</i></strong> 外掛匯入到 wpDiscuz。','Here you can manage comment content related options, such as comment text length, comment content breaking, comment image attachment... By default wpDiscuz allows to attach one image with comment. For an advanced media uploading and file attachment options we recommend %s addon.'=>'您可以在此處管理與留言內容相關的選項，例如留言文字長度、留言內容斷開、留言圖片附件...預設情況下，wpDiscuz允許將一個圖片附加在留言中。對於進階媒體上傳和檔案附件選項，我們建議使用 %s 外掛。','Here you can manage comment layout components. You can display/hide certain button or information on comment threads, as well as commenters\' avatars and comment voting options.'=>'您可以在此處管理留言佈局組件。您可以 顯示/隱藏 留言串上的某些按鈕或訊息，以及留言者的頭像和留言投票選項。','Here you can manage comment thread styles, custom colors and add custom CSS. By default wpDiscuz comes with &laquo;Light&raquo; style. If your theme style is dark, we recommend choose the &laquo;Dark&raquo; option for comments too. In case you want to totally customize comment style or create it from scratch, we recommend choose the &laquo;Off&raquo; option to stop loading wpDiscuz core CSS. In this case only basic CSS code will be loaded allowing you add your custom style easier.'=>'您可以在此處管理留言串的樣式，自訂顏色並增加自訂 CSS。預設情況下，wpDiscuz 帶有&laquo;淺色&raquo;樣式。如果您的主題樣式為深色，建議您也選擇&laquo;深色&raquo;選項作為留言樣式。如果要完全自訂留言樣式，或從頭開始建立留言樣式，建議選擇 &laquo;關閉&raquo; 選項，以停止載入 wpDiscuz 核心 CSS。在這種情況下，將只會載入基本 CSS 代碼，使您可以更輕鬆地增加自訂樣式。','Here you can manage commenters authorization and data control related settings. wpDiscuz is focused on user engagement and community building ideas, therefore it\'s integrated with community builder plugins like wpForo Forum, BuddyPress, etc... With these plugins comment authors are linked to their profile pages. In case you want to display commenters profile and activity information directly on comment list, please be sure to check out the %s addon.'=>'您可以在這裡管理留言者授權和與資料控制相關的設定。wpDiscuz 專注於使用者參與和社區建設思想，因此與 wpForo 論壇，BuddyPress 等社區構建器外掛整合在一起。透過這些外掛，留言作者連結到其個人資料頁面。如果您想直接在留言列表中顯示留言者資料和活動訊息，請務必確認 %s 外掛。','Hi [COMMENT_AUTHOR],<br/><br/>your comment was approved.<br/><br/><a href="[COMMENT_URL]">[COMMENT_URL]</a><br/><br/>[COMMENT_CONTENT]'=>'嗨 [COMMENT_AUTHOR],<br/><br/>您的留言已核准。<br/><br/><a href="[COMMENT_URL]">[COMMENT_URL]</a><br/><br/>[COMMENT_CONTENT]','Hi [FOLLOWER_NAME],<br/><br/> new comment has been posted by the <em><strong>[COMMENT_AUTHOR]</em></strong> you are following<br/><br/><a href="[COMMENT_URL]">[COMMENT_URL]</a><br/><br/>[COMMENT_CONTENT]<br/><br/><a href="[CANCEL_URL]">'=>'嗨 [FOLLOWER_NAME]，<br/><br/>您關注的<em><strong>[COMMENT_AUTHOR]</em></strong>發布了新留言<br/><br/><a href="[COMMENT_URL]">[COMMENT_URL]</a><br/><br/>[COMMENT_CONTENT]<br/><br/><a href="[CANCEL_URL]">','Hi [MENTIONED_USER_NAME]!<br/>You have been mentioned in a comment posted on "[POST_TITLE]" post by [COMMENT_AUTHOR].<br/><br/>Comment URL: <a href="[COMMENT_URL]">[COMMENT_URL]</a>'=>'[MENTIONED_USER_NAME] 您好！<br/> [COMMENT_AUTHOR] 在 「[POST_TITLE]」文章上發表的留言中提到您。<br/><br/>留言URL：<a href="[COMMENT_URL]"> [COMMENT_URL] </a>','Hi [SUBSCRIBER_NAME],<br/><br/> new comment has been posted by the <em><strong>[COMMENT_AUTHOR]</em></strong> on the discussion section you\'ve been interested in<br/><br/><a href=\'[COMMENT_URL]\'>[COMMENT_URL]</a><br/><br/>[COMMENT_CONTENT]<br/><br/><a href=\'[UNSUBSCRIBE_URL]\'>Unsubscribe</a>'=>'嗨 [SUBSCRIBER_NAME]，<br/><br/><em><strong>[COMMENT_AUTHOR]</em></strong> 已在您感興趣的討論區塊，發佈了新留言<br/ ><br/><a href=\'[COMMENT_URL]\'>[COMMENT_URL]</a><br/><br/>[COMMENT_CONTENT]<br/><br/><a href=\'[UNSUBSCRIBE_URL]\' >取消訂閱</a>','Hi [SUBSCRIBER_NAME],<br/><br/> new reply has been posted by the <em><strong>[COMMENT_AUTHOR]</em></strong> on the discussion section you\'ve been interested in<br/><br/><a href=\'[COMMENT_URL]\'>[COMMENT_URL]</a><br/><br/>[COMMENT_CONTENT]<br/><br/><a href=\'[UNSUBSCRIBE_URL]\'>Unsubscribe</a>'=>'嗨 [SUBSCRIBER_NAME]，<br/><br/>新回覆已由<em><strong>[COMMENT_AUTHOR]</em></strong>發佈在您感興趣的討論區塊<br/ ><br/><a href=\'[COMMENT_URL]\'>[COMMENT_URL]</a><br/><br/>[COMMENT_CONTENT]<br/><br/><a href=\'[UNSUBSCRIBE_URL]\' >取消訂閱</a>','Hi, <br/> You just started following a new user. You\'ll get email notification once new comment is posted by this user. <br/> Please click on "user following confirmation" link to confirm your request. If you believe this is an error, ignore this message and we\'ll never bother you again. <br/><br/><a href="[POST_URL]">[POST_TITLE]</a><br/><br/><a href="[CONFIRM_URL]">'=>'嗨，<br/>您剛剛開始關注一位新使用者。該使用者發布新留言後，您將收到電子郵件通知。<br/>請點擊「使用者關注確認」連結以確認您的請求。如果您認為這是誤操作，請忽略此訊息，您將不會再收到此訊息。 <br/><br/><a href="[POST_URL]">[POST_TITLE]</a><br/><br/><a href="[CONFIRM_URL]">','Hi, <br/> You just subscribed for new comments on our website. This means you will receive an email when new comments are posted according to subscription option you\'ve chosen. <br/> To activate, click confirm below. If you believe this is an error, ignore this message and we\'ll never bother you again. <br/><br/><a href=\'[POST_URL]\'>[POST_TITLE]</a><br/><br/><a href=\'[CONFIRM_URL]\'>Confirm Your Subscription</a><br/><br/><a href=\'[CANCEL_URL]\'>Cancel Subscription</a>'=>'您好，<br/> 您剛剛訂閱了我們網站上的新留言。這表示當您所選擇的訂閱選項發佈新留言時，您將收到一封電子郵件。<br/> 要啟用，請點擊下面的確認。如果您認為這是誤傳，請忽略此訊息，我們將不再打擾您。 <br/><br/><a href=\'[POST_URL]\'>[POST_TITLE]</a><br/><br/><a href=\'[CONFIRM_URL]\'>確認您的訂閱</a> <br/><br/><a href=\'[CANCEL_URL]\'>取消訂閱</a>','Hide comment section for roles'=>'隱藏角色的留言區塊','Hide Replies'=>'隱藏回覆','Highlight Unread Comments'=>'標示未讀取的留言','Highlight Voting Buttons for Voters'=>'突顯投票按鈕於使用者','Hottest comment thread'=>'最熱門留言','Hour'=>'小時','hour'=>'小時','Hours'=>'小時','hours'=>'小時','Hours (Plural Form)'=>'小時','HTML Code'=>'HTML代碼','https://gvectors.com/'=>'https://gvectors.com/','https://wpdiscuz.com/'=>'https://wpdiscuz.com/','I agree to receive email'=>'我同意接收電子郵件','I allow to create an account'=>'我同意建立一個帳號','I allow to use my email address and send notification about new comments and replies (you can unsubscribe at any time).'=>'我允許使用我的電子郵件地址並發送有關新留言和回覆的通知（您可以隨時取消訂閱）。','I can\'t resolve the problems!'=>'我無法解決問題！','I couldn\'t understand how to make it work'=>'我無法理解如何使其工作','I didn\'t like plugin design'=>'我不喜歡外掛的設計','I found a better plugin'=>'我找到更好的外掛','I want to downgrade to previous 5.x version!'=>'我想降級到以前的5.x版本！','I\'ll reactivate it later'=>'我稍後會重新啟用它','ID'=>'ID','If the Bubble live update is enabled, it shows new comments excerpts as a pop-up information to article reads in real-time. This keeps website visitors up to date and engages them join to the discussion.'=>'如果啟用了氣泡即時更新，它將顯示新的留言摘要作為即時閱讀文章的彈出訊息。這樣可以使網站訪客保持最新狀態，並吸引他們加入討論。','If there is no new comments while visitor read the article, in most cases they don\'t even think about leaving some comment. The Bubble helps here too, it calls article readers to join to the discussion displaying them invite message. This message attracting readers attention and allows them fast and easy jump to comment area. Once page is loaded and visitor has read some content, it reminds about comments and calls to leave a reply.'=>'如果訪客在閱讀文章時沒有新的留言，則在大多數情況下，他們甚至不考慮發表留言。氣泡在這裡也有幫助，它呼籲文章讀者加入討論並向他們顯示邀請訊息。該訊息吸引了讀者的注意，並允許他們快速輕鬆地跳轉到留言區域。載入頁面且訪客閱讀了某些內容後，它會提醒您有關留言和呼叫的資訊，以供回覆。','If this option is enabled only parent comments will be displayed. This increases page load speed and keeps pages light. If visitor wants to read replies he/she just need to click on [view replies (12)] button located on all parent comments which have replies.'=>'如果啟用此選項，則僅顯示上層留言。這樣可以提高頁面載入速度並保持頁面簡潔。如果訪客想閱讀回覆，則只需點擊所有具有回覆的上層留言上的 [ 查看回覆(12) ]按鈕即可。','If this option is enabled, all Social Login buttons become not-clickable until user accept automatic account creation process based on his/her Social Network Account shared information (email, name). This checkbox and appropriate information will be displayed when user click on a social login button, prior to the login process. This extra step is added to comply with the GDPR'=>'如果啟用此選項，則所有社群登入按鈕都將變得不可點擊，直到會員接受 他/她 的社群網路帳號共享資訊（電子郵件，姓名）的自動帳號建立流程。 當會員在登入過程之前點擊社群登入按鈕時，將顯示此複選框和適當的訊息。 這個額外的步驟被增加以符合GDPR','If you disable this option, it\'ll hide the entire section of comments. Neither the comment form nor the comment list will be visible for guests.'=>'如果禁用此選項，它將隱藏整個留言區塊。留言表單和留言列表都不會顯示給訪客。','If you enable this option, please make sure you\'ve inserted the Valid OAuth Redirect URI in according field when you create Facebook Login App. Your website OAuth Redirect URI is displayed above.'=>'如果啟用此選項，請確保在建立 Facebook 登入應用程式時，根據欄位中插入了有效的 OAuth 轉址URI。您的網站 OAuth 轉址 URI 顯示在上方。','If you want to use the latest Version 3 - Invisible Google reCAPTCHA with comment form, please checkout %s addon. This will make your commenters life easier, letting them pass through with ease.'=>'如果您想使用帶有留言表格的最新版本3 - 隱藏的 Google reCAPTCHA，請檢查 %s 外掛。這會使留言的人更輕鬆便利，並讓他們更輕易通過。','If you want us to contact you please click on "I agree to receive email" checkbox, then fill out your email. We\'ll try to do our best to help you with problems.'=>'如果您希望我們與您聯繫，請點擊「我同意接收電子郵件」複選框，然後填寫您的電子郵件。我們將盡力為您解決問題。','Ignore non-https content'=>'忽略非 https 內容','Ignore subscription'=>'忽略訂閱','Image Source URL to Image Conversion'=>'圖片來源網址到圖片轉換','Import Comment Images'=>'匯入留言圖片','Import images'=>'匯入圖片','Import Options'=>'匯入設定','Import Phrases'=>'匯入慣用語','Import Subscriptions'=>'匯入訂閱','Import subscriptions'=>'匯入訂閱','IMPORTANT! Uninstall is not a simple deactivation action. This action will permanently remove all forum data (forums, topics, replies, attachments...) from database. Please backup database before this action, you may need this forum data in future. If you are sure that you want to delete all forum data please confirm. If not, just cancel it, then you can deactivate this plugin, that will not remove forum data.'=>'重要！刪除不是簡單的停用操作。此操作將從資料庫中永久刪除所有討論區資料（討論區、主題、回覆、附件...）。 在此操作之前請備份資料庫，您將來可能需要此討論區資料。如果您確定要刪除所有討論區資料，請確認後再操作。如果沒有，只需取消它，然後您可以停用此外掛，並不會刪除討論區資料。','IMPORTANT: In case your theme uses old versions of Font-Awesome lib, you should not disable this this option. The theme old version doesn\'t support new version icons, thus some wpDiscuz icons might be lost.'=>'重要說明：如果您的主題使用舊版本的 Font-Awesome 庫，則不應禁用此選項。主題舊版本不支持新版本的圖示，因此某些 wpDiscuz 圖示可能會遺失。','In most cases article readers don\'t even think about leaving some comment. Using this option you can enable Bubble &laquo;Invite to Comment&raquo; message. Once page is loaded and visitor has read some content, it reminds about comments and calls to leave a reply.'=>'在多數情況下，文章讀者甚至都不會考慮發表留言。使用此選項，您可以啟用氣泡邀請留言訊息。載入頁面且訪客閱讀了某些內容後，它會提醒您有關留言和行動呼籲的訊息，以提高使用者回覆意願。','In most cases the big part of your visitors are not a native speakers of your language. Make your comments comprehensible for all visitors using wpDiscuz Comment Translation addon. It adds smart and intuitive AJAX \'Translate\' button with 60 language translation options. Uses free translation API.'=>'在多數情況下，訪客大部分的母語並非網站所使用的語言。使用 wpDiscuz 留言翻譯外掛讓所有訪客理解您的留言。它增加了智慧和直覺的AJAX「翻譯」按鈕，以及60種語言翻譯選項。都是使用免費的翻譯API。','In response to:'=>'回應：','In wpDiscuz 7 the real-time commenting becomes more live and attractive. It\'s based on REST API and doesn\'t overload your server. A specific sticky comment icon on your web pages, called &laquo;Bubble&raquo; keeps article readers and commenters up to date. It displays new comments as pop-up information or as a number in an orange circle.'=>'在 wpDiscuz 7中，即時留言變得更加生動有趣。它建構於 REST API，因此不會使伺服器過載。您網頁上的特定黏性留言圖示氣泡，可以使文章讀者和留言者保持最新狀態。它以彈出訊息或橙色圓圈中的數字形式顯示新留言。','Increase Your Comments!'=>'增加您的留言！','Increase your income using ad banners. Comment area is the most active sections for advertising. wpDiscuz Ads Manager addon is designed to help you add banners and control ads in this section.'=>'使用廣告橫幅增加您的收入。 留言區是廣告活動最活躍的部分。 wpDiscuz 廣告管理器外掛旨在幫助您在本節中增加橫幅和控制廣告。','Information: '=>'資訊：','Initiate AJAX loading after page'=>'頁面載入後透過AJAX載入','Initiates AJAX loading once page loading is complete'=>'頁面載入完成後啟動AJAX載入','Inline Commenting'=>'內嵌留言','Inline Comments'=>'內嵌留言','Inline Feedback'=>'內嵌反饋','Inline Feedback Icon Colors'=>'內嵌反饋圖示顏色','Inline Feedbacks'=>'內嵌反饋','Inline feedbacks'=>'內嵌反饋','Input is too long'=>'輸入太長','Input is too short'=>'輸入太短','Instagram App ID'=>'Instagram App ID','Instagram App Secret'=>'Instagram App Secret','Instagram Application ID and Application Secret  required.'=>'需要 Instagram 應用程式ID 和 應用程式密鑰。','Instagram authentication failed (OAuth code does not exist).'=>'Instagram 身份驗證失敗（OAuth代碼不存在）。','Instagram authentication failed (OAuth state does not exist).'=>'Instagram 身份驗證失敗（OAuth狀態不存在）。','Instagram Login Button'=>'Instagram 登入按鈕','Installed'=>'已安裝','instruction &raquo;'=>'指示 &raquo;','Integrates myCRED Badges and Ranks. Converts wpDiscuz comment votes/likes to myCRED points. '=>'整合 myCRED 標籤和級別。轉化 wpDiscuz 留言 投票/讚 為 myCRED 積分。','Integrates wpDiscuz with BuddyPress plugin. Profile Tabs, Notifications, Activities, etc...'=>'將 wpDiscuz 與 BuddyPress 外掛整合。個人資料標籤、通知、活動...等','Invalid Captcha Code'=>'無效的驗證碼','Invalid Data !!!'=>'無效資料 ！！！','Invert Selection'=>'反向選擇','It\'s not what I was looking for'=>'It\'s not what I was looking for','It\'s totally improved with brand new innovative features bringing live to your website and discussions.'=>'全新的創新功能完全改善了您網站討論的即時性。','Italic'=>'斜體','Jetpack Comments are active.'=>'Jetpack留言功能處於啟用狀態。','Jetpack Comments doesn\'t allow wpDiscuz comment form to be loaded on your posts and pages. It overwrites wpDiscuz Comment form.'=>'Jetpack 留言不允許將 wpDiscuz 留言表單載入到您的文章和頁面上。它會覆蓋 wpDiscuz 的留言表單。','Jetpack comments is active, please deactivate!'=>'Jetpack留言功能處於啟用狀態，請停用！','Join the discussion'=>'加入討論','Just 3 Steps to Complete Installation!'=>'僅需3個步驟即可完成安裝！','Just 3 Steps to Complete Update!'=>'僅需3個步驟即可完成更新！','Just log in to the translation platform with your WordPress.org account, and suggest translations.'=>'只需使用您的 WordPress.org 帳號登入翻譯平台，然後提出翻譯建議。','Just replace http protocols to https (https may not be supported by content provider)'=>'只需將 http 協議替換為 https（內容提供商可能不支持 https）','Keep checked the "Notify of new replies to this comment" option by default'=>'預設情況下維持勾選「通知此留言的新回覆」選項','Keep guest commenter credentials in browser cookies for X days'=>'在瀏覽器 Cookie 中將訪客留言者憑證保留 X 天','Keep your page loading speed high by disabling comments loading. Once the page loading is complete, this option will initiate AJAX request and load comments without affecting page loading speed. Also, you can select the [View Comments] button option to allow visitors load comments manually whenever they want.'=>'透過禁用留言載入來維持較高的頁面載入速度。頁面載入完成後，此選項將啟動AJAX請求並載入留言，而不會影響頁面載入速度。另外，您可以選擇 [查看留言] 按鈕選項，以允許訪客在需要時手動載入留言。','Key'=>'Key','label color'=>'標籤色','Language'=>'語言','Language codes'=>'語言代碼','Last 6 Months'=>'最近六個月','Last Activity'=>'最近留言','Last edited %1$s by %2$s'=>'最近由 %2$s 編輯的 %1$s','Last Month'=>'上個月','Last Week'=>'上週','Last Year'=>'去年','Layout'=>'佈局','Layout #1'=>'佈局 #1','Layout #2'=>'佈局 #2','Layout #3'=>'佈局 #3','Layout Components'=>'佈局組件','Lazy load comments on scrolling'=>'捲動式延遲載入留言','Leave a Good Review'=>'留下好評價','Left Corner'=>'左下角','Let your commenters help you to determine and remove spam comments. wpDiscuz Report and Flagging addon comes with comment reporting tools. Automaticaly auto-moderates comments based on number of flags and dislikes.'=>'讓您的留言者幫助您確認並刪除垃圾留言。 wpDiscuz 檢舉和標記外掛附帶留言檢舉工具。 自動根據旗標和不喜歡的數量自動調節留言內容。','Light'=>'淺色','Limit Comments per User'=>'每個使用者的留言限制','Link'=>'連結','Linkedin authentication failed (OAuth code does not exist).'=>'Linkedin身份驗證失敗（OAuth代碼不存在）。','Linkedin authentication failed (OAuth state does not exist).'=>'Linkedin身份驗證失敗（OAuth狀態不存在）。','LinkedIn Client ID'=>'LinkedIn 客戶端ID','Linkedin Client ID and Client Secret  required.'=>'Linkedin 客戶端ID 和 客戶端密鑰 為必填。','LinkedIn Client Secret'=>'LinkedIn 客戶端密鑰','LinkedIn Login Button'=>'LinkedIn 登入按鈕','Live Commenting and Notifications'=>'即時留言和通知','Live Notification / Bubble'=>'即時通知 / 泡泡框','Live Notification, Bubble!'=>'即時通知、泡泡框','Live Preview | Buy'=>'預覽 | 購買','Live Update'=>'線上更新','Load all comments'=>'載入所有留言','Load Font Awesome css lib'=>'載入 Font Awesome CSS庫','Load More Button'=>'載入更多按鈕','Load More Comments'=>'載入更多留言','Load Rest of Comments'=>'載入剩餘留言','Load Rich Editor'=>'載入所見所得編輯器','Load with page'=>'載入