al Form)'=>'分鐘','Mobile and Desktop'=>'手機和桌機','Month'=>'月','month'=>'月','months'=>'月','Months (Plural Form)'=>'月','More Addons...'=>'更多外掛...','More Comment Widgets! Most voted comments, Active comment threads, Most commented posts, Active comment authors widgets are available in wpDiscuz Widgets Addon'=>'更多留言小工具！ 最多投票留言、活躍留言串、留言最多的文章、活躍留言作者小工具在 wpDiscuz 小工具外掛中可用','More Info &raquo;'=>'更多資訊 &raquo;','More information about'=>'關於更多資訊','More News'=>'更多新聞','Most reacted comment'=>'最相關留言','Most Voted'=>'得票最多','Most voted comments, Active comment threads, Most commented posts, Active comment authors'=>'票數最高的留言、活躍的留言串、留言數最多的文章、活躍的留言者','Move'=>'搬移','My content and settings'=>'我的內容與設定','Name'=>'名字','Name For Total'=>'總計名稱','New Comment'=>'新留言','new follow-up comments'=>'新留言回覆','new replies to my comments'=>'我的留言有新回覆','New Reply'=>'新回覆','New Reply notification content'=>'新回覆通知內容','New reply notification subject'=>'新回覆通知主題','New value new line'=>'一列一個值','New wpDiscuz addon!'=>'新的 wpDiscuz 附加元件！','Newest'=>'最新','Newest and oldest comment ordering by'=>'最新和最舊的留言排序','Next Step &raquo;'=>'下一步 &raquo;','No'=>'否','No data found!'=>'找不到資料！','No text is selected. Please select a part of text from post content.'=>'沒有選擇檔案。請從文章內容中選擇一部分文字。','None'=>'無','Not allowed file type'=>'不允許的檔案類型','Not whitelisted value detected'=>'未檢測到白名單值','Nothing found in Trash'=>'垃圾箱中找不到任何東西','Notification'=>'提醒','Notification Phrases'=>'提醒慣用語','Notify comment author once comment is approved'=>'一旦留言被批准通知留言作者','Notify me via email when a new reply is posted'=>'發表新回覆時透過電子郵件通知我','Notify of'=>'提醒','Notify of new replies to this comment'=>'通知對此留言的新回覆','Notify on all new replies'=>'新回覆的提醒','Notify on new comments'=>'新留言的提醒','Notify on new replies to this comment'=>'通知對此留言的新回覆','Off'=>'關閉','OK Application ID'=>'OK 應用程式ID','OK Application ID, Application Key  and Application Secret  required.'=>'OK Application ID, Application Key  和 Application Secret 為必填。','OK Application Key'=>'OK 應用程序密鑰','OK Application Secret'=>'OK 應用程式密鑰','OK authentication failed (access_token does not exist).'=>'OK 身份驗證失敗 (OAuth <code>access_token</code> 不存在)。','OK authentication failed (code does not exist).'=>'OK 身份驗證失敗 (OAuth <code>code</code> 不存在)。','OK authentication failed (OAuth state does not exist).'=>'OK 身份驗證失敗 (OAuth <code>state</code> 不存在)。','OK Login Button'=>'OK 登入按鈕','OK Share Button'=>'OK 分享按鈕','Ok, I understood'=>'好，我明白了','Oldest'=>'最舊','Once a question is added in article editor (backend), on article (front-end) readers will see a small comment icon next to the text part you\'ve selected. This feature engages post readers inviting them comment and leave a feedback while reading without scrolling down and using the standard comment form.'=>'在文章編輯器（後端）中增加問題後，在文章（前端）上，讀者將在您選擇的文字部分旁邊看到一個小留言圖示。 此功能可以吸引文章閱讀器，邀請他們發表留言，並在閱讀時留下反饋，而無需向下捲動和使用標準留言表單。','Once a question is added in article editor (backend), on article (front-end), readers will see a small comment icon next to the text part you\'ve selected. This feature engages post readers inviting them comment and leave a feedback without scrolling down and using the standard comment form. Thus they leave reply and react to post content or questions during the reading process.'=>'在文章編輯器（後端），文章（前端）中增加問題後，讀者會在所選文字部分旁邊看到一個小留言圖示。此功能可以吸引文章閱讀器，邀請他們發表留言並留下反饋，而無需向下滾動並使用標準留言表單。因此，他們在閱讀過程中留下答覆，並對文章內容或問題做出反應。','Once a question is added in article editor (backend), readers will see a small comment icon (call to leave a feedback) next to the text part you\'ve selected for your question on article (front-end). This icon calls people to leave a feedback, using the type you\'ve selected in this option. For example, if you\'ve chosen the "Blink" option, once reader scrolled  and reached to the article text with question, it animates with comment button size and color changes attracting readers attention.'=>'在文章編輯器（後端）中增加問題後，讀者會在您為文章問題（前端）選擇的文字部分旁邊看到一個小留言圖示（要求留下反饋）。此圖示會使用您在此選項中選擇的類型來呼籲人們留下反饋。例如，如果您選擇了「閃爍」選項，則當讀者捲動並到達帶有問題的文章文字時，它將透過註釋按鈕的大小，和顏色變化進行動畫處理，進而引起讀者的注意。','Once image is uploaded, it\'ll generate thumbnails according to your selected sizes. When you set up a new WordPress website, the platform gives you three image sizes to play with: thumbnail, medium, and large (plus the file\'s original resolution). You may have other options and sizes which are registered by current active theme and by other plugins.'=>'圖片上傳後，會根據您選擇的尺寸來產生縮略圖。當您建立一個新的 WordPress 網站時，該平台會為您提供三種圖片尺寸供您使用：縮略圖、中型和大型（加上檔案的原始解析度）。您可能還有其他選項和大小，這些選項和大小由目前啟用的主題和其他外掛來控制。','Once new comment is posted, Bubble shows pop-up message with the new comment excerpt as it\'s shown on screenshot. The small &laquo;Reply&raquo; button allows to reply that comment immediately or readers can click on the pop-up notification and jump to that comment thread below the article. Just make sure the Bubble Live Update is enabled in wpDiscuz > Settings > Live Commenting and Notifications options.'=>'發表新留言後，氣泡會顯示彈出訊息，並帶有新留言的摘要，如畫面截圖所示。小的「回覆」按鈕允許立即回覆該留言，或者讀者可以點擊彈出式通知，並跳至文章下方的該留言主題。只需確保在 wpDiscuz > 設置 > 即時留言和通知選項中啟用了氣泡即時更新。','Only Desktop'=>'僅桌機','Only logged in customers who have purchased this product may leave a review.'=>'只有已購買此產品的登入會員才能發表留言。','Open'=>'開啟','Open Settings'=>'開啟設定','Open the Feedback Form on scroll'=>'在捲動軸上開啟反饋表單','OPENED'=>'開啟','Options Imported Successfully!'=>'設定匯入成功！','Options were backed up!'=>'設定已備份！','Ordered List'=>'編號','Other'=>'其他','Overview & Comments Statistic'=>'概況和留言統計','Participate in this discussion via email'=>'通過電子郵件參與討論','Password'=>'密碼','Per Post'=>'每篇文章','Permission Denied !!!'=>'沒有權限 ！','Permitted URI redirects'=>'允許的 URI 轉址','Phrases'=>'慣用語','Phrases Imported Successfully!'=>'慣用語成功匯入！','Phrases updated'=>'慣用語更新','Phrases were backed up!'=>'慣用語已備份！','Please %s to comment'=>'請 %s 發表留言','Please %s with Google to obtain the Site Key and Secret Key for %s. Then insert those keys in according fields below.'=>'請 %s 與 Google 取得 %s 的 Site Key 和 Secret Key。然後將這些 Key 插入下面的欄位中。','Please check one of reasons before sending feedback!'=>'在發送反饋之前請檢查其中一個原因！','Please check this option on to help wpDiscuz get more popularity as your thank to the hard work we do for you totally free. This option adds a very small (16x16px) icon under the comment section which will allow your site visitors recognize the name of comment solution you use.'=>'勾選此項，以幫助 wpDiscuz 更受歡迎，因為您感謝我們為您完全免費的努力工作。此選項在留言部分增加了一個非常小的（16x16px）圖示，這將允許您的網站訪問者識別您使用的留言外掛程式名稱。','Please check your email and confirm the follow'=>'請檢查您的電子郵件並確認以下內容','Please check your email and confirm the user following request.'=>'請檢查您的電子郵件並確認使用者關注請求。','Please check your email.'=>'請查看你的電子信箱。','Please click on buttons to disable or enable. The enabled buttons are colored green, the disabled buttons are gray. If you want to disable the whole formatting toolbar, please click on the [Disable formatting buttons] button. Options to manage Image Attachment button are located in \'Comment Content and Media\' setting page.'=>'請點擊按鈕以禁用或啟用。啟用的按鈕顯示為綠色，禁用的按鈕顯示為灰色。如果要禁用整個格式化工具欄，請點擊 [禁用格式化按鈕] 按鈕。管理「附件圖片」按鈕的選項位於「留言內容和媒體」的設定頁面中。','Please complete required steps to start using wpDiscuz 7'=>'請完成所需的步驟，以開始使用 wpDiscuz 7','Please disable Jetpack Comments.'=>'請禁用 Jetpack 留言。','Please fill out required fields'=>'請填寫必填欄位','please fill out this field to comment'=>'留言前請先填寫此欄位','Please insert one value per line'=>'請每行插入一個值','Please leave a feedback on this'=>'請對此提供反饋','Please let us know why you are deactivating. Choosing one of the options below you will help us make it better for you and for other users.'=>'請讓我們知道您為什麼選擇停用。請從下面選擇其中一項，以幫助我們做得更好，並為您和其他使用者提供更多協助。','Please login to comment'=>'請登入後發表留言','Please login to follow users'=>'請登入以關注此會員','Please login to follow users.'=>'請登入以關注此會員。','Please provide a plugin name or URL'=>'請提供外掛名稱或 URL','Please provide more information'=>'請提供更多資訊','Please rebuild ratings for the best performance and fastest experience'=>'請重建評級以獲得最佳效能和更快的使用者體驗','Please remove wpDiscuz template files from your active theme\'s /wpdiscuz/ folder.'=>'請從啟用主題的 /wpdiscuz/ 資料夾中刪除 wpDiscuz 模板檔案。','Please synchronize comment data for the best performance and fastest experience'=>'請同步留言資料以取得最佳效能和速度體驗','Please update wpDiscuz addons in Dashboard > Plugins admin page, then activate those back.'=>'請在 控制台 > 外掛 管理頁面中更新 wpDiscuz 外掛，然後將其啟用。','Please use this link to cancel all follows for new comments. Please note, that this action cannot be undone.<br/><br/><a href="[DELETE_FOLLOWS_URL]" target="_blank">Delete all my follows</a><br/><br/>'=>'請使用此連結取消所有關注以取得新留言。請注意，此操作無法復原。<br/><br/><a href="[DELETE_FOLLOWS_URL]" target="_blank">刪除我的所有關注</a><br/><br/>','Please use this link to cancel all subscriptions for new comments. Please note, that this action cannot be undone.<br/><br/><a href="[DELETE_SUBSCRIPTIONS_URL]" target="_blank">Delete all my subscriptions</a><br/><br/>'=>'請使用此連結取消所有新留言的訂閱。請注意，此操作無法復原。<br/><br/><a href="[DELETE_SUBSCRIPTIONS_URL]" target="_blank">刪除我的所有訂閱</a><br/><br/>','Please use this link to delete all your comments. Please note, that this action cannot be undone.<br/><br/><a href="[DELETE_COMMENTS_URL]" target="_blank">Delete all my comments</a><br/><br/>'=>'請使用此留言刪除您的所有留言。請注意，此操作無法復原。<br/><br/><a href="[DELETE_COMMENTS_URL]" target="_blank">刪除我的所有留言</a><br/><br/>','Plugin Customization'=>'外掛客製化','Plugin Usage Feedback'=>'外掛使用意見回報','Post'=>'Post','Post Comment'=>'發表留言','Post comment notification content'=>'發表留言通知內容','Post comment notification subject'=>'發表留言通知主題','Post ID not exists'=>'文章ID不存在','Post IDs'=>'表單 ID','Post Rating Title'=>'文章評分標題','Post Types'=>'文章類型','Postmatic allows your users subscribe to comments. Instead of just being notified, they add a reply right from their inbox.'=>'Postmatic 允許您的使用者訂閱留言。他們不僅可以收到通知，還可以直接在收件夾中直接回覆。','Postmatic subscription label'=>'Postmatic 訂閱標籤','Primary buttons background'=>'主按鈕背景','Primary buttons text'=>'主按鈕文字','Primary Color'=>'主色','Prior to the wpDiscuz 7 release, we\'ve released new versions of all wpDiscuz addons. If you\'ve already using the latest versions, just activate those back. If your license key is expired and you cannot update, please renew those addons at gVectors Store with 30% discount applied automatically at checkout page. Just make sure you\'re logged-in in the store with your customer account.'=>'在 wpDiscuz 7 發行之前，我們已經發布了所有 wpDiscuz 附加元件的新版本。如果您已經在使用最新版本，只需將其啟用即可。如果您的授權金鑰已過期，且無法順利更新，請在 gVectors 商店續訂那些附加元件，並在結帳頁面自動享受 30% 的折扣。只要確保您使用客戶帳戶登入商店即可。','Privacy and GDPR'=>'隱私和 GDPR','Public Key'=>'公開金鑰(Public Key)','Purge All Caches'=>'清除所有快取','Purge Comment and User Caches'=>'清除留言和使用者快取','Purge comments and users caches'=>'清除留言和使用者快取','Purge Expired Avatar Caches'=>'清除過期的頭像快取','Purge This Url Caches'=>'清除此 URL 快取','QQ AppID'=>'QQ AppID','QQ AppKey'=>'QQ AppKey','QQ AppKey and AppSecret  required.'=>'需要 QQ AppKey 和 AppSecret。','QQ authentication failed (access_token does not exist).'=>'QQ 身份驗證失敗（access_token不存在）。','QQ authentication failed (code does not exist).'=>'QQ 身份驗證失敗（代碼不存在）。','QQ authentication failed (OAuth state does not exist).'=>'QQ 身份驗證失敗（OAuth狀態不存在）。','QQ Login Button'=>'QQ 登入按鈕','Quicktag is a on-click button that inserts HTML in to comment textarea. For example the "b" Quicktag will insert the HTML bold tags < b > < /b >.'=>'「快速標籤」是一個點擊按鈕，可將 HTML 插入到留言文字區域。例如，"b" 快速標籤將插入 HTML 粗體標籤 < b > < /b >。','Rating Star Colors'=>'評分星級顏色','Rating Stars Active Color'=>'評分星級互動顏色','Rating Stars Hover Color'=>'評分星級懸停顏色','Rating Stars Inactive Color'=>'評分星級未互動顏色','Read More'=>'閱讀更多','Read more &raquo;'=>'閱讀更多 &raquo;','Read the documentation'=>'閱讀說明','Real-time online user checking, pop-up notification of new online users and online/offline badges.'=>'即時線上會員檢查，彈出新的線上會員通知以及 在線/離線 徽章。','Rebuild Ratings'=>'重建評分','reCAPTCHA  verification failed.'=>'reCAPTCHA 驗證失敗。','reCAPTCHA Language'=>'reCAPTCHA 語言','reCAPTCHA Settings'=>'reCAPTCHA 設定','reCAPTCHA Theme'=>'reCAPTCHA 主題','reCAPTCHA v2'=>'reCAPTCHA v2','reCAPTCHA V2 Secret Key'=>'reCAPTCHA V2 Secret Key','reCAPTCHA V2 Site Key'=>'reCAPTCHA V2 網站密鑰','reCaptcha validation fails. '=>'reCaptcha 驗證失敗。 ','reCaptcha validation fails. Error code: '=>'eCaptcha驗證失敗。錯誤代碼：','reCAPTCHA Version 2'=>'reCAPTCHA 版本 2','Redirect First Comment to'=>'將第一條留言轉址到','Redirect URI'=>'轉址URI','Regenerate Closed Comments'=>'重新產生已關閉的留言','Regenerate Comments\' Data'=>'重新產生留言資料','Regenerate Vote Data'=>'重新產生投票資料','Regenerate Vote Metas'=>'重新產生投票 Meta','register your domain'=>'註冊您的域名','Remember Logged-in Status'=>'記住登入狀態','Remove Vote Data'=>'移除投票數據','Remove vote data'=>'移除投票數據','Replace non-https content to simple link URLs'=>'將非 https 內容替換為簡單連結網址','Replace old meta key'=>'取代舊的 meta key','Reply'=>'回覆','Reply Text Length'=>'回覆文字長度','Reply to'=>'回覆','Report and Flagging'=>'檢舉並標記','Request Method'=>'請求方式','Reset All Options'=>'重置所有選項','Reset Fields Ratings'=>'重置評分欄','Reset Phrases'=>'重置慣用語','Reset Post Rating'=>'重置文章評價','Reset Ratings'=>'重置評分','Reset Tab Options'=>'重置頁籤選項','Reverse Child Comments Order'=>'反轉次級留言順序','Rich Editor Toolbar Buttons'=>'所見及所得編輯器工具欄按鈕','Right Corner'=>'右下角','right now'=>'馬上','Save'=>'儲存','Save Changes'=>'儲存變更','Save edited comment button text'=>'儲存編輯的留言按鈕文字','Save my data for the next time I comment'=>'儲存我的資料，以便下次發表留言','Scroll to the comment after posting'=>'發佈後捲動到留言','Search engines rank web pages for mobile devices totally different. For the mobile devices, there are more restrictions for JS and CSS files loading. This is the main reason why wpDiscuz disables the Rich Editor for mobile devices by default. It\'s only enabled for desktop. If you have good cache and website optimizer plugins you can enable the rich editor for mobile devices as well.'=>'搜尋引擎對行動裝置的網頁排名完全不同。對於行動裝置，JS 和 CSS 檔案載入受到更多限制。這是 wpDiscuz 預設情況下禁用行動裝置的所見及所得編輯器的主要原因。僅在桌面上啟用。如果您擁有良好的快取和網站優化工具外掛，則可以為行動裝置啟用所見及所得的編輯器。','Search Forms'=>'搜尋表單','Second'=>'秒','second'=>'秒','Seconds'=>'秒','seconds'=>'秒','Seconds (Plural Form)'=>'秒','Secret'=>'Secret','Secret Key'=>'私密金鑰','Secure comment content in HTTPS protocol.'=>'在HTTPS協議下安全留言內容。','Secure Key'=>'Secure Key','See comment likers and voters of each comment. Adds user reputation and badges based on received likes.'=>'查看每個留言的留言者和投票者留言。 根據收到的讚來加入會員榮譽和徽章。','Select a part of text and ask readers for feedback (inline commenting)'=>'選擇一部分文字並要求讀者提供反饋（內嵌留言）','Select a part of text, add inline commenting form in post content using the green &laquo;Comment&raquo; button on post editor toolbar. Once it\'s added in article editor (backend), on article (front-end) readers will see a small comment icon next to the text part you\'ve selected.'=>'選擇文字的一部分，使用文張編輯器工具欄上的綠色「留言」按鈕在文章內容中，增加內嵌留言表單。將其增加到文章編輯器（後端）後，在文章（前端）上，讀者將在您選擇的文字部分旁邊看到一個小註釋圖示。','Select All'=>'全選','Selected Text'=>'所選文字','Send E-Mail Notification to Mentioned Users'=>'寄送電子郵件通知給被標註的使用者','separate count'=>'單獨計數','Server \'post_max_size\' is '=>'伺服器 \'post_max_size\' 為 ','Server \'upload_max_filesize\' is '=>'伺服器 \'upload_max_filesize\' 為 ','Set comments order to "Most voted" by default'=>'將留言順序預設為「投票數最高」','Set this option value 0, to turn off comment text breaking function.'=>'設置為0，則關閉留言文本縮略功能。','Settings'=>'設定','Settings updated'=>'設定更新','Share'=>'分享','Share On Facebook'=>'分享至Facebook臉書','Share On Odnoklassniki'=>'分享至Odnoklassniki','Share On Twitter'=>'分享至Twitter','Share On VKontakte'=>'分享至VK','Share On WhatsApp'=>'分享到 WhatsApp','Shortcode above will work for registered users only'=>'上面的短代碼只適用於註冊會員','Show "Login" link on comment form'=>'在留言表單上顯「登入」連結','Show Activity Tab'=>'顯示活動頁籤','Show Comment Date'=>'顯示留言日期','Show Comment Link'=>'顯示留言連結','Show Comments Media in Dashboard'=>'在控制台中顯示留言媒體','Show Follows Tab'=>'顯示訂閱頁籤','Show Subscriptions Tab'=>'顯示訂閱頁籤','Show Voting Buttons'=>'顯示投票按鈕','Single Image Sizes in Comments'=>'留言中的單張圖片大小','Site Key'=>'網站 Key','Sitewide'=>'全站','Social Login'=>'社群登入','Social login agreement  description'=>'社群登入協議描述','Social login agreement label'=>'社群登入協議標籤','Social Login and Commenting'=>'社群登入和留言','Social Login and Share'=>'社群登入和分享','SocketPost'=>'SocketPost','Some of field value is invalid'=>'一些欄位值無效','Something is wrong'=>'發生了些錯誤','Something is wrong with %s addon license and files. Please activate it using its license key. If this addon has not been purchased and downloaded from the official gVectors.com website, it\'s probably hacked and may lead to lots of security issues.'=>'%s 附加元件授權和檔案有問題。請使用其授權密鑰啟用它。如果此附加元件尚未從官方 gVectors.com 網站購買和下載，則它可能已被駭客入侵，並可能導致許多安全問題。','Sometimes registered users comment as guest using the same email address. wpDiscuz can detect the account role using guest email and display commenter label correctly.'=>'有時註冊會員未登入時使用相同的 Email 來留言。wpDiscuz可以基於訪客Email探測帳戶並顯示正確留言人','Sorry, the comment was not updated'=>'對不起，留言未更新','Sorry, this comment is no longer possible to edit'=>'抱歉，該留言已無法編輯','Sorry, uploading not allowed for this post'=>'抱歉，此文章不允許上傳','Sorry, we couldn\'t send confirmation email'=>'抱歉，我們無法發送確認電子郵件','Sorry, we couldn\'t send confirmation email.'=>'抱歉，我們無法發送確認電子郵件。','Sort by'=>'排序','Source Code'=>'原始碼','Spoiler'=>'收合選單','Spoiler Title'=>'收合選單標題','Start Rebuild'=>'開始重建','Start Regenerate'=>'開始產生','Start Sync'=>'開始同步','Start the discussion'=>'發表留言','Start Using wpDiscuz'=>'開始使用 wpDiscuz','Starting from wpDiscuz 7 you can choose the [ Off ] option of comment style. It\'ll remove most of wpDiscuz CSS code and allow you write your own CSS for custom comment styling.'=>'從 wpDiscuz 7 開始，您可以選擇留言樣式的 [關閉] 選項。它將刪除大部分 wpDiscuz CSS 代碼，並允許您編寫自己的 CSS 以用於自訂留言樣式。','Step 1'=>'步驟1','Step 2'=>'步驟2','Step 3'=>'步驟3','Stick'=>'置頂','Stick Button - Stick a comment thread'=>'置頂按鈕 - 置頂一則討論串留言','Stick button title'=>'置頂按鈕標題','Stick this comment'=>'置頂此留言','Sticky'=>'置頂','Sticky comment icon title'=>'置頂留言圖示標題','Sticky Comment Thread'=>'置頂留言串','Strike'=>'刪除線','Structure of Human Readable Date Format'=>'可讀日期格式的結構','Style Specific Colors'=>'樣式特定的顏色','Styles and Colors'=>'樣式和顏色','Submit &amp; Deactivate'=>'提交 &amp; 停用','Subscribe'=>'訂閱','Subscribe to all comments of this post'=>'訂閱此文章的所有留言','Subscribe to all replies to my comments'=>'訂閱對我留言的所有回覆','Subscribed on all your comments replies'=>'有留言的回覆則提醒','Subscribed on this comment replies'=>'訂閱此留言的回覆','Subscribed on this post'=>'已訂閱此文章的留言','subscribed to all follow-up comments of this post'=>'訂閱了此文章的所有後續留言','subscribed to my comments'=>'訂閱我的留言','subscribed to this comment'=>'訂閱此留言','Subscribers'=>'訂閱人數','Subscription - all comments'=>'訂閱 - 所有留言','Subscription - comment'=>'訂閱 - 留言','Subscription - posts'=>'訂閱 - 文章','Subscription and User Following'=>'訂閱和使用者關注','Subscription Confirmation'=>'訂閱確認','Subscription confirmation email content'=>'訂閱確認郵件內容','Subscription confirmation email subject'=>'訂閱確認郵件主題','Subscription Fault'=>'訂閱錯誤','Subscription type: All my comments'=>'訂閱類型：我的所有留言','Subscription type: Post comments'=>'訂閱類型：發表留言','Subscription type: Single comment'=>'訂閱類型：單一留言','Subscription types in Subscription Bar drop-down'=>'訂閱欄下拉選單中的訂閱類型','Subscriptions'=>'訂閱','Support'=>'技術支援','Support & Community'=>'支援 & 社群','Synchronize Commenters Data'=>'同步留言者資料','Syntax highlighting for comments, automatic language detection and multi-language code highlighting.'=>'留言的語法高亮、自動語言檢測和多語系代碼高亮。','Text Color'=>'文字顏色','Thank you for installing wpDiscuz!'=>'感謝您安裝wpDiscuz！','Thank you for your feedback'=>'感謝您反饋的意見','Thank you for your feedback!'=>'感謝您的回報與建議！','Thank You!'=>'感謝您！','Thank you!'=>'謝謝！','The "My Content & Settings" button is located in comment filter panel on top of all comments, right after the [X Comments] phrase. This button opens a pop-up window allowing commenters manage their content and settings.'=>'「我的內容和設定」按鈕位於所有留言頂部的留言篩選器面板中，緊鄰在 [X 留言] 短語之後。此按鈕將開啟一個彈出視窗，允許留言者管理其內容和設定。','The &laquo;Layout #1&raquo; is the simplest and cleanest layout. The &laquo;Layout #2&raquo; is designed for narrow comment sections. It displays comment content in wider area. The &laquo;Layout #3&raquo; layout is designed to accent comment thread hierarchy by colored vertical lines and indents.'=>'佈局#1 是最簡單、最乾淨的佈局。佈局#2 專為狹窄的留言區塊而設計。它在更大的區域顯示留言內容。佈局#3 主要是透過彩色垂直線和縮排來突顯留言的層次架構。','The attachment not exists'=>'附件不存在','The Bubble is also designed to invite article readers to comment. It displays invite message allowing them fast and easy jump to comment area.'=>'氣泡目的在於邀請文章讀者發表留言。它會顯示邀請訊息，讓使用者可以快速輕鬆地跳轉到留言區域。','The note text and the label of this checkbox can be managed in Comments > Phrases > Social Login tab.'=>'說明文字和此複選框的標籤可以在留言>慣用語>社群登入選項標籤中進行管理。','The number of already left feedbacks will be displayed next to the feedback icon allowing people click and read other\'s feedbacks in the same place. Also, those feedbacks will be displayed with other standard comments in article comment section below.'=>'已留下的反饋數量將顯示在反饋圖示旁邊，使人們可以在同一位置點擊並閱讀其他人的反饋。同樣，這些反饋將與其他標準留言一起顯示在下面的文章留言部分。','The number of words before breaking comment text (Read more)'=>'斷開留言文字之前的字數（閱讀更多）','The plugin is great, but I need specific features'=>'該外掛很棒，但我需要特定的功能','The plugin is not working'=>'此外掛無法運作','The plugin works very slow'=>'該外掛執行起來非常緩慢','The red marked post types are already attached to other comment form. If you set this form too, the old forms will not be used for them.'=>'紅色標記的帖子類型已附加到其他留言表單。 如果你也設置了這個表單，舊的表單將不會被用於他們。','The request is invalid or malformed.'=>'該請求無效或格式錯誤。','The response is no longer valid: either is too old or has been used previously.'=>'回應不再有效：過期或以前使用過。','The response parameter is invalid or malformed.'=>'回應參數無效或格式錯誤。','The response parameter is missing.'=>'缺少回應參數。','The second type, is the old, comment depended way. You should create a "Rating" custom field in comment form allowing people to rate while they leave a comment. If you\'ve already configured the second type (Rating comment field) in comment form, the first type will be automatically disabled. Both types of ratings can be managed in %s'=>'第二種是基於留言的舊方法。您應該在留言表單中建立「評分」自訂欄位，允許人們在發表留言時進行評分。如果您已經在留言表單中配置了第二種類型（「評分留言」欄位），則第一種類型將被自動禁用。兩種類型的評分都可以在 %s 中進行管理','The secret parameter is invalid or malformed.'=>'secret參數無效或格式錯誤。','The secret parameter is missing.'=>'secret參數遺失。','Theme'=>'主題','These options allows you manage comment section colors individaly for the Default and Dark Styles'=>'這些選項使您可以分別管理預設樣式和深色樣式的留言區塊顏色','These tools are available only in <a href=\'https://gvectors.com/product/wpdiscuz-media-uploader/\'><strong><i>wpDiscuz Media Uploader</i></strong></a> addon! Please install and activate it to use importer!'=>'這些工具僅在 <a href=\'https://gvectors.com/product/wpdiscuz-media-uploader/\'><strong><i>wpDiscuz 媒體上傳器</i></strong></a> 附加元件中可使用！請安裝並啟用它以使用匯入器！','This allows users to see own voted comments.'=>'這可以讓使用者查看自己投票的留言。','This Bubble is also designed to invite article readers to comment. It displays invite message allowing them fast and easy jump to comment area.'=>'此氣泡目的在於邀請文章讀者發表留言。它顯示邀請訊息，使他們可以快速輕鬆地跳轉到留言區域。','This filter button appears next to all filter buttons and comment sorting options. It allows to filter and display article inline feedbacks (comments made while reading current article).'=>'該篩選器按鈕出現在所有篩選器按鈕和留言排序選項旁邊。它允許篩選和顯示文章內嵌反饋（閱讀目前文章時發表的留言）。','This is closed comment thread'=>'此討論串已關閉','This option allows commenters to attach an image with comments.'=>'此選項使留言者可以在留言時附加圖片。','This option allows control commenting activity per user. You can set maximum number of comments users can leave per post or sitewide. It also allow to set restriction for comments or for replies only.'=>'此選項允許每個使用者進行控制留言活動。您可以設置每個文章或網站範圍內，使用者可以發表留言的上限。它還允許設置留言或只能回覆的限制。','This option allows embedding other plugins shortcodes in comment content. Some plugin shortcodes work very slow, so this may affect your page load speed if the shortcode provider plugin is not well optimized.'=>'此選項允許在留言內容中嵌入其他外掛的短代碼。某些外掛短代碼的執行速度非常慢，因此，如果短代碼外掛所提供程式優化不佳，這可能會影響您的頁面載入速度。','This option allows mentioning users in comments using @nickname method. Mentioned users will get notification via email if the next option is enabled. To get an advanced user mentioning features and to be able mention comments by #CommentID, we recommend the %s addon.'=>'此選項允許使用 @nickname 方式，在留言中標註使用者。如果啟用了下一個選項，則被標註的使用者將會透過電子郵件收到通知。為了獲得進階使用者標註功能並透過 #CommentID 提及留言，我們建議使用 %s 外掛。','This option detects images and other contents with non-https source URLs and fix according to your selected logic.'=>'此選項會使用非 https 來源網址檢測圖片和其他內容，並根據您選擇的邏輯進行修復。','This option enables comment sorting buttons (newest | oldest | most voted). Sorting buttons are not available for the default comments pagination type [1][2][3]... It\'s only active for [Load more] and other AJAX pagination types.'=>'此選項啟用留言排序按鈕（最新 | 最早 | 最高票數）。排序按鈕不適用於預設留言分頁類型 [1] [2] [3] ...。僅對 [載入更多] 和其他 AJAX 分頁類型有效。','This option hides the entire section of comments. Neither the comment form nor the comment list will be visible for selected user roles.'=>'此選項隱藏整個留言部分。對於選定的使用者角色、留言表單和留言列表都不顯示。','This option only related to avatars in comment system. For sitewide avatar control, please use WordPress native avatar settings in Dashboard > Settings > Discussions admin page.'=>'此選項僅與留言系統中的頭像相關。對於網站範圍的頭像控制，請在 控制台 > 設置 > 留言管理頁面中，使用 WordPress 本機頭像設定。','This version is mostly focused on website visitors engagement,'=>'此版本主要著重於網站訪客的參與度，','Thread Replies'=>'留言串回覆','Title'=>'標題','To downgrade wpDiscuz, you should deactivate and delete wpDiscuz 7 plugin. Then download the previous 5.3.2 version ZIP file from wpDiscuz plugin page (use dropdown menu under statistic graphics). And install the ZIP file in Dashboard > Plugins > Add Plugin admin page. The downgrading is only recommended to gain a time to do template customizations or wait for help from our support team. Once the issues are resolved, you should update to latest wpDiscuz version.'=>'要降級 wpDiscuz，應停用並刪除 wpDiscuz 7 外掛。 然後從 wpDiscuz 外掛頁面下載以前的 5.3.2 版本的 ZIP 檔案（使用統計圖形下的下拉選單）。並在資訊主頁 > 外掛 > 增加外掛管理頁面中來安裝 ZIP 檔案。僅建議降級以爭取時間來進行自訂模板，或等待我們的支援團隊的協助。解決問題後，您應該更新到最新的 wpDiscuz 版本。','To get the Application ID, Key and Secret, you should create an app using one of the supported types (external, Android, iOS), use this'=>'要取得應用程式ID、密鑰和 Secret，您應該使用一種受支持的類型（外部、Android、iOS）建立應用程式，請使用','To post a comment'=>'為發表留言','to post a comment.'=>'為發表留言','To start using Baidu Login Button you should get Client Id and Client Secret. Please follow to this '=>'要開始使用 Baidu 登入按鈕，您應該取得客戶端ID和客戶端密鑰。請遵循此','To start using Disqus Login Button you should get Public Key and Secret Key. Please follow to this '=>'要開始使用 Disqus 登入按鈕，您應該取得 公開金鑰 和 私密金鑰。請遵循此','To start using Facebook Login and Share Buttons you should get Facebook Application Key and Secret for your website. Please follow to this'=>'要開始使用 Facebook 登入和分享按鈕，您應該為您的網站獲得 Facebook APP Key 和 Secret。 請依照這個','To start using Google Login Button you should get Client ID and  Client Secret for your website. Please follow to this'=>'要開始使用 Google 登入按鈕，您應該取得網站的客戶端ID和客戶端密鑰。請遵循此','To start using Instagram Login Button you should get Client ID and Client Secret. Please follow to this '=>'要開始使用 Instagram 登入按鈕，您應該取得客戶端ID和客戶端密鑰。請遵循此','To start using Linkedin Login Button you should get Client ID and Client Secret. Please follow to this '=>'要開始使用 Linkedin 登入按鈕，您應該取得客戶端ID和客戶端密鑰。請遵循此','To start using Mail.ru Login Button you should get Client ID and Client Secret. Please follow to this '=>'要開始使用 Mail.ru 登入按鈕，您應該取得客戶端ID和客戶端密鑰。請遵循此','To start using Tencent QQ Login Button you should get AppID and AppKey. Please follow to this '=>'要開始使用 QQ 登入按鈕，您應該取得 AppID 和 AppKey。請遵循此','To start using Twitter Login Button you should get Consumer Key and Secret for your website. Please follow to this'=>'要開始使用 Twitter 登入按鈕，您應該為您的網站取得 Consumer Key 和 Secret 。 請按照這個','To start using VK Login Button you should get Application ID and Secure Key. Please follow to this '=>'要開始使用 VK 登入按鈕，您應該獲得 Application ID 和 Secure Key。 請按照這個','To start using WeChat Login Button you should get AppID and Secret. Please follow to this '=>'要開始使用 WeChat 登入按鈕，您應該取得 AppID 和 Secret。請遵循此','To start using Weibo Login Button you should get App Key and App Secret. Please follow to this '=>'要開始使用 Weibo 登入按鈕，您應該取得 App Key 和 App Secret。請遵循此','To start using Wordpress.com Login Button you should get Client ID and Client Secret. Please follow to this '=>'要開始使用 Wordpress.com 登入按鈕，您應該取得客戶端ID和客戶端密鑰。請遵循此','To start using Yandex Login Button you should get Client ID and Client Secret. Please follow to this '=>'要開始使用 Yandex 登入按鈕，您應該取得客戶端ID和客戶端密鑰。請遵循此','Today'=>'今天','Tools'=>'工具','Total control over comment subscriptions. Full list, monitor, manage, filter, unsubscribe, confirm...'=>'完全控制留言訂閱。 完整列表，監控，管理，過濾，取消訂閱，確認...','total count'=>'合計數','Translation'=>'翻譯','Twitter - Consumer Key (API Key)'=>'Twitter - Consumer Key (API Key)','Twitter - Consumer Secret (API Secret)'=>'Twitter - Consumer Secret (API Secret)','Twitter authentication failed (OAuth secret does not exist).'=>'Twitter 身份驗證失敗 (OATH secret 不存在)。','Twitter Callback URL'=>'Twitter Callback URL','Twitter connection failed.'=>'Twitter 連接失敗。','Twitter Consumer Key and Consumer Secret  required.'=>'Twitter Consumer Key 和 Consumer Secret 為必填。','Twitter Login Button'=>'Twitter 登入按鈕','Twitter Share Button'=>'Twitter 分享按鈕','Two column'=>'兩欄','Unable to send an email'=>'不能發送郵件','Underline'=>'底線','Unfollow'=>'取消關注','Unfollow this user'=>'取消關注此會員','Uninstall'=>'刪除','Unlimit'=>'無限','Unordered List'=>'項目符號','Unread comments background'=>'未讀留言背景','Unselect All'=>'取消全選','Unstick'=>'取消置頂','Unsubscribe'=>'不訂閱','Update Comment List Every'=>'更新每則留言列表','url is invalid'=>'無效的URL網址','Use Facebook OAuth2'=>'使用 Facebook OAuth2','Use FTP client or hosting service cPanel > File Manager tool. WordPress theme folders are located in /wp-content/themes/ directory. The active theme folder can be detected by name.'=>'使用 FTP 客戶端或託管服務 cPanel >檔案管理器工具。WordPress 主題資料夾位於 /wp-content/themes/ 目錄中。可以依照名稱檢測啟用的主題資料夾。','Use guest email to detect registered account'=>'使用訪客 E-mail 匹配已註冊帳戶','Use Plugin .PO/.MO Files'=>'使用外掛程式的 .PO/.MO 文件','Use Postmatic for subscriptions and commenting by email'=>'使用 Postmatic 進行訂閱和透過電子郵件發表留言','Use the "Deactivate" button located next to the "Learn More" button. Just click on this button and Jetpack Comments will be deactivated. Once it\'s disabled, please delete all caches.'=>'使用「了解更多」按鈕旁邊的「停用」按鈕。只需點擊此按鈕，Jetpack 留言將被停用。停用後，請刪除所有快取。','Use Website URL as Profile URL'=>'使用網站網址作為個人檔案網址','Use WordPress Date/Time Format'=>'使用 WordPress 日期/時間格式','Use WordPress native AJAX functions'=>'使用 WordPress 原生 AJAX 函數','User agreement prior to a social login action'=>'在社群登入操作前達成使用者協議','User and Comment Mentioning'=>'會員和留言提及','User Authorization and Profile Data'=>'使用者授權和個人檔案資料','User Commenters'=>'使用者留言','User Following Confirmation'=>'使用者關注確認','User Labels and Badges'=>'使用者標籤和徽章','User Labels are small rectangles with specific background colors indicating comment author role, such as Guest, Member, Author, Admin, etc... These labels can be enabled and disabled for certain user role. Also you can change label colors using according options below.<br> Besides labels you can enable User Reputation, Badges and Ranks based on user activity, using %s addon. This addon integrates wpDiscuz comment system with an adaptive user points management plugin %s.'=>'使用者標籤是帶有特定背景顏色的小矩形，用於區別留言的作者角色，例如：Guest、Member、Author、Admin...等。這些標籤可以為某些使用者角色啟用和禁用。您還可以使用下面的選項來更改標籤顏色。<br>除了標籤，您還可以使用 %s 外掛根據使用者活動來開啟使用者名聲、徽章和等級。該外掛將 wpDiscuz 留言系統與合適的使用者積分管理外掛 %s 整合在一起。','User Settings'=>'使用者設定','User Settings Phrases'=>'會員設定慣用語','Using this tool you can backup wpDiscuz options or migrate them from one WordPress to another.'=>'您可以使用此工具備份 wpDiscuz 選項，或將它們從一個 WordPress 搬移到另一個。','Using this tool you can backup wpDiscuz phrases or migrate them from one WordPress to another.'=>'您可以使用此工具備份 wpDiscuz 慣用語，或將它們從一個 WordPress 遷移到另一個。','Using this tool you can fix database tables.'=>'您可以使用此工具修復資料庫表。','Using this tool you can rebuild ratings.'=>'您可以使用此工具重建評級。','Using this tool you can regenerate closed comments.'=>'您可以使用此工具重新產生已關閉的留言。','Using this tool you can regenerate comment vote data.'=>'您可以使用此工具重新產生留言投票資料。','Using this tool you can regenerate comment vote metas.'=>'您可以使用此工具重新產生留言投票 Meta 資料。','Using this tool you can synchronize comment author data.'=>'您可以使用此工具同步留言作者資料。','Using wpDiscuz User &amp; Comment Mentioning addon you can allow commenters mention comments and users in comment text using #comment-id and @username tags.'=>'使用 wpDiscuz 會員 &amp;  留言提及外掛，您可以使用 #comment-id 和 @username 標記允許留言者在留言文字中提及留言和會員。','Valid OAuth Redirect URI'=>'有效的 OAuth 轉址 URI','value can not be less than'=>'值不能小於','value can not be more than'=>'值不能大於','Values'=>'值','View all comments'=>'檢視所有留言','View Comments'=>'檢視留言','View Replies'=>'查看回覆','View wpDiscuz Addons Bundle'=>'查看 wpDiscuz 擴充套件','VK Application ID'=>'VK 應用程式ID','VK authentication failed (OAuth code does not exist).'=>'VK 身份驗證失敗（OAuth代碼不存在）。','VK authentication failed (OAuth state does not exist).'=>'VK 身份驗證失敗（OAuth狀態不存在）。','VK authentication failed (user_id does not exist).'=>'VK 身份驗證失敗（user_id不存在）。','VK Client ID and Client Secret  required.'=>'VK 客戶端ID 和 客戶端密鑰 為必填。','VK Login Button'=>'VK 登入按鈕','VK Secure Key'=>'VK Secure Key','VK Share Button'=>'VK 分享按鈕','vote'=>'投票','Vote Counted'=>'投票數','Vote Down'=>'不喜歡','Vote Up'=>'喜歡','votes'=>'票數','Voting Buttons Icon'=>'投票按鈕圖示','Voting Error'=>'投票錯誤','We are sorry, but you can\'t follow this user.'=>'很抱歉，您無法關注此會員。','We are sorry, following failed. Please try again later.'=>'很抱歉，關注失敗。請稍後再試。','We are sorry, following this user is impossible'=>'很抱歉，無法關注此會員','We are sorry, you are not allowed to comment more than %d time(s)'=>'很抱歉，您在時間內發表的留言不得超過 %d 個','We are sorry, you are not allowed to comment more than %d time(s)!'=>'很抱歉，您在時間內發表的留言不得超過 %d 個！','We are sorry, you are not allowed to create a new comment thread more than %d time(s)'=>'很抱歉，您在時間內新增的留言串不得超過 %d 個','We are sorry, you are not allowed to reply more than %d time(s)'=>'很抱歉，您在時間範圍內回覆次數不得超過 %d 次','We are sorry, you are not allowed to reply more than %d time(s)!'=>'很抱歉，您在時間範圍內回覆次數不得超過 %d 次！','We love your reviews. This is the best way to say thank you to developers and support team.'=>'我們喜歡您的評價。這是對開發人員和支援團隊表示感謝的最佳方式。','We\'d really appreciate if you could help translating wpDiscuz to your language.'=>'如果您能協助將 wpDiscuz 轉換為您的語言，我們將非常感謝。','Website'=>'網站','WebSite URL'=>'網站','WeChat App ID'=>'WeChat App ID','WeChat AppKey and AppSecret  required.'=>'需要 WeChat 的 AppKey 和 AppSecret。','WeChat authentication failed (access_token does not exist).'=>'WeChat 身份認證失敗（access_token不存在）。','WeChat authentication failed (code does not exist).'=>'WeChat 身份認證失敗（代碼不存在）。','WeChat authentication failed (OAuth state does not exist).'=>'WeChat 身份認證失敗（OAuth狀態不存在）。','WeChat Login Button'=>'WeChat 登入按鈕','WeChat Secret'=>'WeChat Secret','Weibo App Key'=>'Weibo App Key','Weibo App Key and App Secret  required.'=>'需要 Weibo App Key 和 App Secret。','Weibo App Secret'=>'Weibo App Secret','Weibo authentication failed (access_token does not exist).'=>'Weibo 身份驗證失敗（access_token不存在）。','Weibo authentication failed (code does not exist).'=>'Weibo 身份驗證失敗（代碼不存在）。','Weibo authentication failed (OAuth state does not exist).'=>'Weibo 身份驗證失敗（OAuth狀態不存在）。','Weibo Login Button'=>'Weibo 登入按鈕','Welcome to wpDiscuz 7'=>'歡迎使用 wpDiscuz 7','What kind of problems do you have?'=>'你有什麼樣的問題？','What part of design you don\'t like or want to change?'=>'您不喜歡或想要更改的設計的哪一部分？','What type of features you want to be in the plugin?'=>'你想在外掛中使用哪些類型的功能？','What\'s New'=>'最新消息','WhatsApp Share Button'=>'WhatsApp 分享按鈕','When you login first time using a Social Login button, we collect your account public profile information shared by Social Login provider, based on your privacy settings. We also get your email address to automatically create an account for you in our website. Once your account is created, you\'ll be logged-in to this account.'=>'當您首次使用社群登入按鈕登入時，我們會根據您的隱私設定收集由社群登入提供商共享的您的帳號公開個人資料訊息。 我們也會收到您的電子郵件地址，在我們的網站上為您自動建立一個帳號。 一旦你的帳號被建立，你就會登入到這個帳號。','Width (px)'=>'寬度 (px)','WordPress Client ID'=>'WordPress 客戶端ID','Wordpress Client ID and Client Secret required.'=>'Wordpress 客戶端ID 和 客戶端密鑰 為必填。','WordPress Client Secret'=>'WordPress 客戶端密鑰','WordPress has already all necessary tools to moderate commends. You can approve, unapprove, mark as spam, delete and do other things with comments in WordPress Dashboard > Comments admin page. <br><br>On front-end you can only edit, close and stick comments. In case you want to have all moderation options on front-end, we recommend checkout %s addon. Besides the comment editing, closing and sticking options, here you can limit users commenting activity. You can set max number of comments per user per post or sitewide, allow them only comment or only reply.'=>'WordPress 已經擁有所有必要的工具來表彰。您可以在 WordPress 訊息中心 > 留言管理頁面中批准、取消批准、標記為垃圾郵件、刪除並執行其他操作。<br><br>在前端，您只能編輯、關閉和黏貼留言。如果您想在前端使用所有審核選項，建議您檢出 %s 外掛。除了留言編輯、關閉和黏貼選項之外，您還可以在此處限制使用者的留言活動。您可以為每個使用者或整個網站設定每位使用者的最大留言數，只允許他們留言或只能回覆。','WordPress Login Button'=>'WordPress 登入按鈕','Wordpress.com authentication failed (access_token does not exist).'=>'Wordpress.com 身份驗證失敗（access_token不存在）。','Wordpress.com authentication failed (OAuth code does not exist).'=>'Wordpress.com 身份驗證失敗（OAuth代碼不存在）。','Wordpress.com authentication failed (OAuth state does not exist).'=>'Wordpress.com 身份驗證失敗（OAuth狀態不存在）。','Wordpress.com authentication failed (user_id does not exist).'=>'Wordpress.com 身份驗證失敗（user_id不存在）。','Working...'=>'執行中...','Would love your thoughts, please comment'=>'您有什麼想法嗎？歡迎留言','Would love your thoughts, please comment.'=>'您有什麼想法嗎？歡迎留言。','wpDiscuz'=>'wpDiscuz','wpDiscuz 7 comes with three modern and totally different comment thread layouts. They are called Layout #1, Layout #2 and Layout #3.'=>'wpDiscuz 7 帶有三種現代且完全不同的留言串佈局。它們分別稱為 佈局#1、佈局#2 和 佈局#3。','wpDiscuz 7 is a revolution in WordPress commenting experience.'=>'wpDiscuz 7是 WordPress 留言體驗的全新進化。','wpDiscuz Add-ons'=>'wpDiscuz 附加元件','wpDiscuz Addons'=>'wpDiscuz 附加元件','wpDiscuz Addons Bundle'=>'wpDiscuz 附加元件組合','wpDiscuz Addons Support'=>'wpDiscuz 附加元件支援','wpDiscuz Advanced Likers addon displays likers and voters of each comment. Adds user reputation and badges based on received likes.'=>'wpDiscuz進階外掛助手顯示每個留言的相關留言的按讚者和投票者。根據收到的喜好來加入會員榮譽和徽章。','wpDiscuz allows users to get all kind of news from your website comment system, such as new comments, new replies, double opt-in subscription, user mentioning, user following and new comments by followed users. You can manage all those options here. All those options are based on email notifications. You can manage email templates in wpDiscuz > Phrases > Email Tab. <br>In wpDiscuz > Dashboard page, you can find a quick overview of user subscriptions. For an advanced subscriptions management tool, please checkout %s addon.'=>'wpDiscuz 允許使用者從您的網站留言系統中取得各種最新動態，例如：新留言、新回覆、雙重選擇訂閱、使用者被標註用、關注使用者和關注使用者的新留言。您可以在此處管理這些所有選項。所有這些選項均採用電子郵件通知。您可以在 wpDiscuz > 短語 > 電子郵件選項卡中管理電子郵件模板。<br>在 wpDiscuz > 控制台頁面中，您可以找到使用者訂閱的快速概況。要使用進階訂閱管理工具，請查看 %s 外掛。','wpDiscuz allows you to customize comment form layout and fields. You can create as much comment forms as you want and attach those to certain post type or page. Please navigate to %s page to manage comment form specific settings.'=>'wpDiscuz 允許您自訂留言表單的佈局和欄位。您可以根據需要建立任意數量的留言表單，並將其附加到某些文章類型或頁面。請前往 %s 頁面以管理留言表單的特定設置。','wpDiscuz comes with built-in social login and share buttons. It includes Facebook, Twitter, Google, Disqus, WordPress.com, VK and OK Social Networks. Here you can configure App IDs and Keys to enable those. Once IDs and Keys are configured you\'ll see social login buttons on top of the main comment form. Social Login buttons are only available for guests, so make sure you\'re logged-out before checking those.'=>'wpDiscuz 帶有內建的社群登入和分享按鈕。它包括 Facebook、Twitter、Google、Disqus、WordPress.com、VK 和 OK社群網路。您可以在此處配置應用ID和密鑰以啟用它們。配置ID和密鑰後，您將在主留言表單頂部看到社群登入按鈕。社群登入按鈕僅適用於訪客，因此在檢查之前請確保您已經登出。','wpDiscuz comes with built-in social login and share buttons. It includes Facebook, Twitter, Google, Disqus, WordPress.org, VK and OK Social Networks. You can enable those by managing API Keys in wpDiscuz > Settings > Social Login and Share options.'=>'wpDiscuz 帶有內建的社群登入和分享按鈕。它包括 Facebook、Twitter、Google、Disqus、WordPress.org、VK 和 OK社群網路。您可以透過在 wpDiscuz > 設置 > 社群登入和分享選項中管理API密鑰來啟用這些密鑰。','wpDiscuz comment system design is totally changed. It comes with three nice layouts. You can even choose different layout for different pages. Three attractive, modern and clean layouts are ready to use. You can choose your proffered layout in wpDiscuz > Forms > Edit Comment Forms screen. Once the layout is changed, don\'t forget to delete all caches. Comment layouts are called simply &laquo;Layout #1&raquo;, &laquo;Layout #2&raquo;, &laquo;Layout #3&raquo;.'=>'wpDiscuz 留言系統的設計已完全變更。它帶有三個不錯的佈局樣式。您甚至可以為不同的頁面選擇不同的佈局。三種美觀、現代且簡潔的佈局已準備就緒。您可以在wpDiscuz > 表單 > 編輯留言表單畫面中選擇提供的佈局。更改佈局後，不要忘記刪除所有快取。留言佈局簡稱為 佈局#1、佈局#2、佈局#3。','wpDiscuz Demo'=>'wpDiscuz 展示範本','wpDiscuz Fields Data'=>'wpDiscuz 欄位資料','wpDiscuz Front-end Phrases'=>'WpDiscuz前端短語','wpDiscuz is the only comment plugin which allows you to subscribe to certain comment replies. This option is located above [Post Comment] button in comment form. You can disable this subscription way by unchecking this option.'=>'wpDiscuz是唯一允許您針對特定的留言訂閱的留言外掛程式。此選項在 [發表留言] 按鈕前顯示，您可以取消勾選、禁用此功能。','wpDiscuz live update is very light and doesn\'t overload your server. However we recommend to monitor your server resources if you\'re on a Shared hosting plan. There are some very weak hosting plans which may not be able to perform very frequently live update requests. If you found some issue you can set the option below 30 seconds or more.'=>'wpDiscuz 即時更新非常輕便，並且不會對您的服務器造成負載。 不過，如果您在共享主機方案中，我們建議您監控您的服務器資源。 有些較弱的託管計劃，可能無法執行非常頻繁的即時更新請求。 如果您發現某些問題，您可以將該選像設定在30秒以下。','wpDiscuz phrase system allows you to translate all front-end phrases. However if you have a multi-language website it\'ll not allow you to add more than one language translation. The only way to get it is the plugin translation files (.PO / .MO). If wpDiscuz has the languages you need you should check this option to disable phrase system and it\'ll automatically translate all phrases based on language files according to current language.'=>'wpDiscuz 慣用語系統使您可以翻譯所有前端慣用語。但是，如果您有多語言網站，則不允許增加多種語言的翻譯。取得它的唯一方法是外掛翻譯檔案（.PO / .MO）。如果wpDiscuz 具有您需要的語言，則應勾選此選項以禁用慣用語系統，它將根據目前語言的語言檔案自動翻譯所有慣用語。','wpDiscuz Plugin Page'=>'wpDiscuz 外掛頁面','wpDiscuz shows Human Readable date format. If you check this option it\'ll show the date/time format set in WordPress General Settings.'=>'wpDiscuz顯示人機友好的日期格式。如果你勾選此項，將按WordPress通用設置來顯示。','wpDiscuz Support'=>'wpDiscuz 支援','wpDiscuz Tools'=>'wpDiscuz工具','wpDiscuz uses WordPress functions to keep guest Name, Email and Website information in cookies. Those are used to fill according fields of comment form on next commenting time. Set this option value -1 to make it unlimited. Set this option value 0 to clear those data when user closes browser.'=>'wpDiscuz 使用 WordPress 功能將訪客名稱、電子郵件和網站資訊保留在 cookie 中。這些用於在下一次留言時根據留言表單填寫欄位。將此選項值設置為 -1 使其不受限制。將此選項值設置為 0 可在使用者關閉瀏覽器時清除這些資料。','wpDiscuz Widgets'=>'wpDiscuz 小工具','Yandex authentication failed (access_token does not exist).'=>'Yandex 身份驗證失敗（access_token不存在）。','Yandex authentication failed (code does not exist).'=>'Yandex 身份驗證失敗（代碼不存在）。','Yandex authentication failed (OAuth state does not exist).'=>'Yandex 身份驗證失敗（OAuth狀態不存在）。','Yandex ID'=>'Yandex ID','Yandex ID and Password  required.'=>'需要Yandex ID 和 密碼。','Yandex Login Button'=>'Yandex 登入按鈕','Yandex Password'=>'Yandex 密碼','Year'=>'年','year'=>'年','years'=>'年','Years (Plural Form)'=>'年','Yes'=>'是','You are logged in as'=>'您是','You are not allowed to vote for this comment'=>'您不能給此留言投票','You are not allowed to vote for this comment (Voting from same IP)'=>'你不能從同一IP對此留言投票','You can add Inline Feedback button in post content using &laquo;Comment&raquo; button on post editor toolbar.'=>'您可以使用文張編輯器工具欄上的 &laquo;留言&raquo; 按鈕在文章內容中增加「內嵌反饋」按鈕。','You can add more emotions to your comments using wpDiscuz Emoticons addon.'=>'您可以使用 wpDiscuz 表情外掛增加更多表情。','You can create custom comment forms with wpDiscuz. wpDiscuz 4 comes with custom comment forms and fields. You can create custom comment forms for each post type, each form can beceated with different form fields, for eaxample: text, dropdown, rating, checkboxes, etc...'=>'您可以使用 wpDiscuz 建立自訂留言表單。 wpDiscuz 4 附帶自訂留言表單和欄位。 您可以為每個帖子類型建立自訂留言表單，每個表單可以使用不同的表單欄位，例如：文字、下拉式選單、評分、複選框...等。','You can enabled comments live update without the Bubble too. There is a separate live update option to keep comment list real-time updating.'=>'您也可以啟用即時留言更新，而無需使用氣泡。有一個單獨的即時更新選項，可以使留言列表被即時更新。','You can let website visitor search in comments. It\'s always more attractive to find a comment about something that interest you. Using wpDiscuz Comment Search addon you\'ll get a nice, AJAX powered front-end comment search form above comment list.'=>'您可以讓網站訪客在留言中搜尋。 找到關於您感興趣的一些流言總是更具吸引力。 使用 wpDiscuz 留言搜尋外掛，您將在留言列表上獲得更好的體驗，基於AJAX的前端留言搜尋表單。','You can let website visitors attach images and files to comments and embed video/audio content using wpDiscuz Media Uploader addon.'=>'您可以讓網站訪客將圖片和檔案附加到留言中，並使用 wpDiscuz Media Uploader 外掛嵌入 影片/音樂 內容。','You can manage the number of comments for [Load more] option in Settings > Discussion page, using "Break comments into pages with [X] top level comments per page" option. To show the default Wordpress comment pagination you should enable the checkbox on beginning of the same option.'=>'您可以在「設置 > 討論」頁面中使用「將留言分解為每頁 [X] 個頂級留言的頁面」選項來管理 [載入更多] 選項的留言數。要顯示預設的 Wordpress 留言分頁，應在同一選項的開頭啟用複選框。','You can moderate comments on front-end using all in one powerful yet simple wpDiscuz Frontend Moderation addon.'=>'您可以在一個功能強大且簡單的 wpDiscuz Frontend Moderation 外掛中使用所有功能對前端進行留言。','You can not delete default field.'=>'您無法刪除預設欄位。','You can not set this value more than \'upload_max_filesize\' and \'post_max_size\'. If you want to increase server parameters please contact to your hosting service support.'=>'您不能將此值設定為超過「upload_max_filesize」和「post_max_size」。如果您想增加伺服器參數，請聯繫您的主機服務支援。','You can select different comment thread layout for different comment forms in %s'=>'您可以為 %s 中的不同留言形式選擇不同的留言串佈局','You can use HTML tags to add links to website Terms and Privacy Policy pages. For example: '=>'您可以使用 HTML標記來增加指向網站條款和隱私政策頁面的連結。 例如：','You can use this form for certain posts/pages specified by comma separated IDs.'=>'您可以將此表單用於由逗號分隔的 ID 指定的 特定文章/頁面。','You can vote only 1 time'=>'你只能投一次','You cancel all your follows successfully'=>'您已成功取消所有關注','You cancel all your subscriptions successfully'=>'您成功取消所有訂閱','You cannot rate again'=>'您無法再次評分','You cannot vote for your comment'=>'您不能為自己的留言投票','You Cannot Vote On Your Comment'=>'你不能給自己的留言投票','You did not create any forms yet'=>'尚未建立任何表單','You do not have sufficient permissions to perform this action'=>'您沒有足夠的權限執行此操作','You have been mentioned in comment'=>'您在留言中被標註','You have two ways to add Post Rating for your blog posts and articles. The first, comment independent type is enabled by default and appears on top of comment section. It allows people rate your articles without leaving comments. '=>'您可以通過兩種方式為部落格文章和文章增加文章評分。預設情況下，第一種與留言無關的類型是啟用的，並顯示在留言區域的頂部。它使人們可以對您的文章進行評分而不會留下留言。','You must be'=>'您必須是','You Must Be Logged In To Vote'=>'您須先登入再投票','You really want to delete this item ?'=>'確定要刪除此項目？','You started following this comment author'=>'您已開始關注此留言作者','You stopped following this comment author'=>'您已停止關注此留言作者','You stopped following this comment author.'=>'您已停止關注此留言作者。','You\'re not allowed to rate here'=>'您無法在此處評分','You\'re subscribed for new follow-up comments on this post'=>'您已訂閱此留言上的新回覆','You\'re subscribed for new replies on all your comments'=>'您已訂閱您所有留言上的新回覆','You\'re subscribed for new replies on this comment'=>'您已訂閱此留言上的新回覆','You\'re subscribed to'=>'您已訂閱了','You\'ve already voted for this comment'=>'您已對此留言投過票了','You\'ve not made any changes'=>'您沒有做出任何更改','You\'ve successfully confirmed your subscription.'=>'你已成功確認訂閱','You\'ve successfully subscribed.'=>'你已成功訂閱','You\'ve successfully unsubscribed.'=>'你已取消訂閱','Your comment here...'=>'您在此處的留言...','Your comment is approved!'=>'您的留言已批准！','Your comments have been deleted from database'=>'您的留言已從資料庫中刪除','Your customized wpDiscuz template files are no longer compatible with wpDiscuz 7.  This is a doable major version update (from 5.x to 7.x) with totally redesigned comment system and template files. You can do the same customization on the new wpDiscuz 7 template files with the same upgrade-safe way in case the new comment layouts don\'t fit your needs. Please find those below.'=>'您自訂的 wpDiscuz 模板檔案不再與 wpDiscuz 7 相容。這是可行的主要版本更新（從5.x到7.x），具有完全重新設計的留言系統和模板檔案。如果新的留言佈局不符合您的需求，您可以使用相同的安全升級方式，對新的 wpDiscuz 7 模板檔案進行相同的自訂。請在下面找到這些。','Your Email'=>'您的 Email','Your Name*'=>'您的姓名*','Your Question to Readers'=>'給讀者的問題']];
